an excellent boss forever.&amp;nbsp; One of my friends suggested me for Custom Bobbleheads, but still I want to know what kind of gift you guys can suggest for my boss?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you!..............&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1764147,"PostDate":1370318876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> Hey guys, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to attend wedding party of my boss next weak. I was just wondering to know what should I buy for him. He is an excellent boss forever.\u00a0 One of my friends suggested me for Custom Bobbleheads, but still I want to know what kind of gift you guys can suggest for my boss?<\/p> <p> Thank you!..............<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"royhoward173@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370062946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270167.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jonson11","Id":270167,"Name":"jonson11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"adda46976011c925be275cad8862a983","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jonson11[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello, \n Hey guys, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to attend wedding party of my boss next weak. I was just wondering to know what should I buy for him. He is an excellent boss forever.  One of my friends suggested me for Custom Bobbleheads, but still I want to know what kind of gift you guys can suggest for my boss? \n Thank you!..............[\/quote] \n \n Is he the type to dress up? Some cufflinks might be nice, or if he carries business cards maybe a monogrammed business card holder? Here are some nice card holders with an option to monogram.[url=\"http:\/\/www.thingsremembered.com\/thumbnail\/Gift-Categories\/Business\/Card-cases\/pc\/122\/c\/2119\/2613.uts?currentIndex=0&amp;amp;pageSize=23&amp;amp;defaultPageSize=16&amp;amp;mode=viewall&amp;amp;parentCategoryId=122&amp;amp;categoryId=2119&amp;amp;subCategoryId=2613&amp;amp;type=thumbnail&amp;amp;fref=gglp&amp;amp;kw=monogrammed_business_card_holder&amp;amp;esvcid=S1370800800_ADOGOE_AGI19342_CRE27464365505_TID519126_RFDd3d3Lmdvb2dsZS5jb20%3d_RAWbW9ub2dyYW1tZWQlMjBidXNpbmVzcyUyMGNhcmQlMjBob2xkZXI%3d\"] Click here.[\/url] \n \n With either gift I might pair it with a gift card or something small from the registry. That way you&#039;re getting something you know he wants, since he registered for it, plus something personal.","Attachments":[],"Id":1766143,"PostDate":1370788120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jonson11<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> Hey guys, I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to attend wedding party of my boss next weak. I was just wondering to know what should I buy for him. He is an excellent boss forever.\u00a0 One of my friends suggested me for Custom Bobbleheads, but still I want to know what kind of gift you guys can suggest for my boss?<\/p> <p> Thank you!..............<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Is he the type to dress up? Some cufflinks might be nice, or if he carries business cards maybe a monogrammed business card holder? Here are some nice card holders with an option to monogram.<a href='http:\/\/www.thingsremembered.com\/thumbnail\/Gift-Categories\/Business\/Card-cases\/pc\/122\/c\/2119\/2613.uts?currentIndex=0&pageSize=23&defaultPageSize=16&mode=viewall&parentCategoryId=122&categoryId=2119&subCategoryId=2613&type=thumbnail&fref=gglp&kw=monogrammed_business_card_holder&esvcid=S1370800800_ADOGOE_AGI19342_CRE27464365505_TID519126_RFDd3d3Lmdvb2dsZS5jb20%3d_RAWbW9ub2dyYW1tZWQlMjBidXNpbmVzcyUyMGNhcmQlMjBob2xkZXI%3d' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> Click here.<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With either gift I might pair it with a gift card or something small from the registry. That way you're getting something you know he wants, since he registered for it, plus something personal.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337119161,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.36.235.231","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4914ec5857eae7ef8c491e7a17d57289","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great idea!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848142,"PostDate":1399152526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great idea!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"74168","Title":"Looking for wedding gift ideas for my boss?","LastPostDate":1399152526},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
