w the quality! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Yes, I created on vistprint. I search for a coupon and received 50% off plus free shipping. For 48 koozies, it cost me $45.\u00a0 <span alt=\":D\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344626652331_1347\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344626652331_1349\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\">I will let you know about the quality once I receive them.<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf0433133bdb64c4d72cf3516a31df11","RawContent":"Thanks so much! Doing all this stuff myself is fun for me!!! \n \n Yes, please feel free to incorporate everything I have shared. Most of my ideas came from searching places like Etsy and then putting my own twist on it. \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JennyBenz[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [color=#800080]WOW Josephine- Everything you&#039;ve done so far has been such an amazing inspiration!! It is all so amazingly creative!! [\/color] \n [color=#800080]I will definitely be using some of these ideas [how you organized &amp;amp; created layouts] to incorporate into some of my projects, hope you don&#039;t mind =) [\/color] \n [color=#800080]You should consider starting your own business for destination weddings!!! [if you haven&#039;t already LOL][\/color] \n [color=#800080]GREAT JOB!!!![\/color] \n \n Quote: \n Originally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Just created my menu cards.... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n and my koozies... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1660157,"PostDate":1346839569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much! Doing all this stuff myself is fun for me!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes, please feel free to incorporate everything I have shared. Most of my ideas came from searching places like Etsy and then putting my own twist on it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JennyBenz<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">WOW Josephine- Everything you've done so far has been such an amazing inspiration!! It is all so amazingly creative!! <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">I will definitely be using some of these ideas [how you organized\u00a0& created layouts]\u00a0to incorporate into some of my projects, hope you don't mind =) <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">You should consider starting your own business for destination weddings!!! [if you haven't already LOL]<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">GREAT JOB!!!!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Just created my menu cards....<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_1628\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and my koozies...<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_2468\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0613f0c50f741d8a6def09f742a2ac3","RawContent":"awesome!! Thanks for the follow up- I will have to search for my own coupon now! :) [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I received the koozies and they looked exactly like the image. The quality is good, they do not feel or look cheap at all. I definitely recommend them.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1660158,"PostDate":1346839588,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> awesome!! Thanks for the follow up- I will have to search for my own coupon now! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I received the koozies and they looked exactly like the image. The quality is good, they do not feel or look cheap at all. I definitely recommend them.<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0873176ea8ed33e301d77c101521646","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Programs and Welcome letter done! I am done! Woot...woot!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_1425\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome letter will be provided to every guest when they check in. I did not go with my original design. Kept parts of it and moved some to the programs.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome Letter&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 51, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva;\"&gt;WELCOME&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva;\"&gt; to MEXICO. We are so excited that you are here to celebrate with us. We feel so blessed to have so many people in our lives who were willing to sacrifice so much to be here with us as we embark on the greatest adventure of our lives. We want to thank you from the bottom of our hearts.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva;\"&gt;To the right is our itinerary. You will always know where Kurt and I will be. Please feel free to join us or choose your own adventure. What you do on your vacation is up to you! On the back is a list of the restaurants &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp; bars and also some other helpful information.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva;\"&gt;Thank you again for your friendship, love and support. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva;\"&gt;With much love and appreciation,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_5678\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"161125\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"353\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161125\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"275\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_4892\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"161124\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"357\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161124\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"278\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_4892\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Program&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_3338\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"161122\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"406\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161122\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"262\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_2698\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"161121\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"405\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161121\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"261\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1660164,"PostDate":1346840420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Programs and Welcome letter done! I am done! Woot...woot!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_1425\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome letter will be provided to every guest when they check in. I did not go with my original design. Kept parts of it and moved some to the programs.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome Letter<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 51, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva\">WELCOME<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva\"> to MEXICO. We are so excited that you are here to celebrate with us. We feel so blessed to have so many people in our lives who were willing to sacrifice so much to be here with us as we embark on the greatest adventure of our lives. We want to thank you from the bottom of our hearts.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva\">To the right is our itinerary. You will always know where Kurt and I will be. Please feel free to join us or choose your own adventure. What you do on your vacation is up to you! On the back is a list of the restaurants &\u00a0 bars and also some other helpful information.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva\">Thank you again for your friendship, love and support. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family: monotype corsiva\">With much love and appreciation,<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_5678\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"161125\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"353\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161125\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"275\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_4892\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"161124\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"357\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161124\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"278\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_4892\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Program<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_3338\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"161122\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"406\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161122\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"262\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1346853971120_2698\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"161121\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"405\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/161121\/width\/350\/height\/700\" width=\"261\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b87d15192ec859494e2dd2d63b729bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD&#039;s, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1675896,"PostDate":1350553436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD's, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","Email":"oliviaawaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350388017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261423.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":236,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Olivia Waugh","Id":261423,"Name":"Olivia Waugh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84e828f70b94579ca3e01e4f4470bde8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD&#039;s, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1677600,"PostDate":1350977469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD's, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","Email":"oliviaawaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350388017,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261423.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":236,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Olivia Waugh","Id":261423,"Name":"Olivia Waugh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6031dea4436d07a667c5ef81c37392e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great examples!! Thank you for sharing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715911,"PostDate":1359991417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great examples!! Thank you for sharing!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamlove24@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"23.24.145.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359496937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265358.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DiggityDawn","Id":265358,"Name":"DiggityDawn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da7ccf81a0396123860dd8ff848d62bd","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Houstonnlh[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I actually used alot of this wording. Thanks so much! Here is something else we added to our wedding welcome page that I found somewhere:\n   \n [i]\"We definitely look forward to sharing our special day with you in Los Cabos, Mexico! We understand this trip is a commitment and expense, and we realize not everyone will be able to make the trip. But we will know that your love is with us on our wedding day, nevertheless![\/i] \n [i]So, here&#039;s to ocean tides, beautiful sunsets and tequila! \"[\/i][\/quote] \n I wish I would have put something like that on my invites \n It&#039;s perfect!","Attachments":[],"Id":1715925,"PostDate":1359992286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Houstonnlh<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I actually used alot of this wording. Thanks so much! Here is something else we added to our wedding welcome page that I found somewhere:<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em>\"We definitely look forward to sharing our special day with you in Los Cabos, Mexico! We understand this trip is a commitment and expense, and we realize not everyone will be able to make the trip. But we will know that your love is with us on our wedding day, nevertheless!<\/em><\/p> <p> <em>So, here's to ocean tides, beautiful sunsets and tequila! \"<\/em><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I wish I would have put something like that on my invites<\/p> <p> It's perfect!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"avonladee@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1330101392,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251887.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"avonladee","Id":251887,"Name":"avonladee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21f4ae5e3ca69ddca6b67cfae2ed20cb","RawContent":"This is awesome! I love the paragraph about the gifts in post #1. I need help with wording in another area. I do not want invited guest talking about our wedding on our fb pages because most of our friends won&#039;t be invited. We are telling people is a small wedding. The reality of it is that a few friends are closer than others so they were invited. I&#039;m just not sure how to tactfully ask family and the few friends invited not to mention the wedding on fb.","Attachments":[],"Id":1792132,"PostDate":1376635978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is awesome! I love the paragraph about the gifts in post #1. I need help with wording in another area. I do not want invited guest talking about our wedding on our fb pages because most of our friends won't be invited. We are telling people is a small wedding. The reality of it is that a few friends are closer than others so they were invited. I'm just not sure how to tactfully ask family and the few friends invited not to mention the wedding on fb.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ana_Steele58@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.72.227.220","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359137473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265082.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AnaSteele58","Id":265082,"Name":"AnaSteele58","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b487ca7bfb41d6581e94472fc80d457","RawContent":"I live the above program and itinerary. Does anyone know where I can find a templet to create something similar? I am not very computer savvy and have no idea how to create one. Any help would be much appreciated!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1796738,"PostDate":1378115537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I live the above program and itinerary. Does anyone know where I can find a templet to create something similar? I am not very computer savvy and have no idea how to create one. Any help would be much appreciated!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nettie0804@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.193.137.111","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1373144578,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271243.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nettie0804","Id":271243,"Name":"Nettie0804","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":48,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
