> Time: 1437886612 / Sun, 26 Jul 2015 04:56:52 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=65378&start=20&SessionId=afbcf58708874b03a05dc1b2adde658a
> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e303e52a5c8733286944a5de6c03bcb2","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=3]I have designed and ordered my invitations. I love vistaprint.com! My 100 invites cost less than $50. If you find the right coupon code for this website you can save soooo much money. [\/size] \n \n [size=3]I did not want to have response cards. Most of my friends and family are technology savvy and if they are not, I know they know how to use a phone. I spoke to a lot of my friends who had gotten married and they said a lot of their RSVP cards were never returned. They ended up having to contact the guests who did not response. I figured, since I am going to have to do that anyways then why not start by having them RSVP by email, text or phone. Saves money on RSVP cards and postage.[\/size] \n \n\n[center] Here is what I wrote:[\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]We look forward to celebrating with you.[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]Please RSVP by August 12, 2012 via[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]EMAIL: XXXXXXXXX@hotmail.com[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]PHONE\/TEXT:[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Josephine (000) 000-0000[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Kurt (000) 000-0000[\/color][\/center]    \n\n[center] [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823616\/width\/404\/height\/627[\/img][\/center]     I am ever so grateful to those who are joining us and did not want them to get us a present. I searched and searched and then combined some sentence I liked. This is the back of the invitation.     \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]About Gifts[\/color] \n \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]The very best present we can receive is your presence at our wedding and your love and support as we embark on this adventure together. Many of you are contributing your time and energy to this event, and for the gift of your participation we thank you.[\/color][\/center] \n \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]To make it easier for the more traditional gift givers among you, we have set up a registry on www.bedbathbeyond.com and[\/color][\/center] \n\n[center] [color=#ff0099]www.honeyfund.com[\/color][\/center] [\/center] \n \n\n[center] [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823618\/width\/415\/height\/632[\/img][\/center][\/quote] \n I am new to BDW and hoping that by replying to this post I will be able to find it again later!  I love your invites and want to keep this in mind.  Several people on here have used vista print....I wasn&#039;t even aware of them...guess it&#039;s a good thing I joined this website :)  I was wandering around the vista print site yesterday and it appears that you create your invitation and order envelopes separately?  That&#039;s not a big deal as it seems many of you were able to still get your invitation at a very cheap price, just thought I would clarify.  Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1640612,"PostDate":1342036115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:12px\">I have designed and ordered my invitations. I love vistaprint.com! My 100 invites cost less than $50. If you find the right coupon code for this website you can save soooo much money. <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:12px\">I did not want to have response cards. Most of my friends and family are technology savvy and if they are not, I know they know how to use a phone. I spoke to a lot of my friends who had gotten married and they said a lot of their RSVP cards were never returned. They ended up having to contact the guests who did not response. I figured, since I am going to have to do that anyways then why not start by having them RSVP by email, text or phone. Saves money on RSVP cards and postage.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> Here is what I wrote:<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">We look forward to celebrating with you.<\/span><\/p> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">Please RSVP by August 12, 2012 via<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">EMAIL: XXXXXXXXX@hotmail.com<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">PHONE\/TEXT:<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Josephine (000) 000-0000<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Kurt (000) 000-0000<\/span><\/div>  \u00a0 <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"InviteFront.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823616\/width\/404\/height\/627\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 460px;\" \/><\/span><\/div>  \u00a0  I am ever so grateful to those who are joining us and did not want them to get us a present. I searched and searched and then combined some sentence I liked. This is the back of the invitation.  \u00a0  <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">About Gifts<\/span> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">The very best present we can receive is your presence at our wedding and your love and support as we embark on this adventure together. Many of you are contributing your time and energy to this event, and for the gift of your participation we thank you.<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">To make it easier for the more traditional gift givers among you, we have set up a registry on www.bedbathbeyond.com and<\/span><\/div> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">www.honeyfund.com<\/span><\/p> <\/div> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Invite2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823618\/width\/415\/height\/632\" style=\"width: 324px; height: 492px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I am new to BDW and hoping that by replying to this post I will be able to find it again later! \u00a0I love your invites and want to keep this in mind. \u00a0Several people on here have used vista print....I wasn't even aware of them...guess it's a good thing I joined this website <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I was wandering around the vista print site yesterday and it appears that you create your invitation and order envelopes separately? \u00a0That's not a big deal as it seems many of you were able to still get your invitation at a very cheap price, just thought I would clarify. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"muellerrl@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341960731,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257722.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RachelTX","Id":257722,"Name":"RachelTX","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d85ed7d7e5c4d4ff0eccec21be554e6a","RawContent":"I ordered the invite and they provide free plain white envelopes. You can upgrade to matching or customized envelopes as well. I have pretty much ordered everything from vista print. Always make sure to google \"vistaprint coupon\" as there are always great deals! When I purchased my invites, I found a code for 90% off! Happy planning! \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RachelTX[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am new to BDW and hoping that by replying to this post I will be able to find it again later!  I love your invites and want to keep this in mind.  Several people on here have used vista print....I wasn&#039;t even aware of them...guess it&#039;s a good thing I joined this website :)  I was wandering around the vista print site yesterday and it appears that you create your invitation and order envelopes separately?  That&#039;s not a big deal as it seems many of you were able to still get your invitation at a very cheap price, just thought I would clarify.  Thanks![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1640707,"PostDate":1342086318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I ordered the invite and they provide free plain white envelopes. You can upgrade to matching or customized envelopes as well. I have pretty much ordered everything from vista print. Always make sure to google \"vistaprint coupon\" as there are always great deals! When I purchased my invites, I found a code for 90% off! Happy planning!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RachelTX<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am new to BDW and hoping that by replying to this post I will be able to find it again later! \u00a0I love your invites and want to keep this in mind. \u00a0Several people on here have used vista print....I wasn't even aware of them...guess it's a good thing I joined this website <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I was wandering around the vista print site yesterday and it appears that you create your invitation and order envelopes separately? \u00a0That's not a big deal as it seems many of you were able to still get your invitation at a very cheap price, just thought I would clarify. \u00a0Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f73576e7c3c4452f761bca6c87f4347","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just created my menu cards....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_1628\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"156723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; and my koozies...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_2468\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"156725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651086,"PostDate":1344598662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just created my menu cards....<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_1628\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and my koozies...<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_2468\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c38be38ad886a8acd0d77f96e79be4b7","RawContent":"Looks great- what do you think of the koozies from Vistaprint and how much did they cost you? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Just created my menu cards.... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n and my koozies... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1651092,"PostDate":1344600071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  