   <body>\r\n                Thanks for sharing! Theses are great examples and you did a wonderful job with the wording!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhughes1511@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1343078554,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258252.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenna1511","Id":258252,"Name":"Jenna1511","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43c8377d21b07c49225945b293042cf1","RawContent":"[color=#800080]WOW Josephine- Everything you&#039;ve done so far has been such an amazing inspiration!! It is all so amazingly creative!! [\/color] \n [color=#800080]I will definitely be using some of these ideas [how you organized &amp;amp; created layouts] to incorporate into some of my projects, hope you don&#039;t mind =) [\/color] \n [color=#800080]You should consider starting your own business for destination weddings!!! [if you haven&#039;t already LOL][\/color] \n [color=#800080]GREAT JOB!!!![\/color] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Just created my menu cards.... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n and my koozies... \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1652049,"PostDate":1344861471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">WOW Josephine- Everything you've done so far has been such an amazing inspiration!! It is all so amazingly creative!! <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">I will definitely be using some of these ideas [how you organized\u00a0& created layouts]\u00a0to incorporate into some of my projects, hope you don't mind =) <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">You should consider starting your own business for destination weddings!!! [if you haven't already LOL]<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #800080\">GREAT JOB!!!!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Just created my menu cards....<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_1628\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156723\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156723\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> and my koozies...<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344611015310_2468\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"156725\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/156725\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenmuller43@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.41.4.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326799602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250048.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyBenz","Id":250048,"Name":"JennyBenz","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":48,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
