{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d1dced3baf920b025a124418480e824","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;My wedding is not until October 12, 2012 but I am a planner. I have been searching around for wording for many things as I like to do a lot of my projects. So I scoured the internet and want to share what I found so that other brides can save time. I will keep adding new items as my planning progresses. If anyone has any other wording that they would like to share, that would be appreciated!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Save the Date Inserts&lt;\/strong&gt; - Along with my save the date magnets, I included information about travel arrangements. I did not want it to be too lengthy.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff3399;\"&gt;Arrangements and accommodations should be made directly with TRAVEL AGENT NAME of TRAVEL COMPANY. In order to keep our group travel plans coordinated we encourage you to contact Nancy at your earliest convenience for&amp;nbsp; discounted pricing and availability.&amp;nbsp; A nominal deposit can be placed to hold your room. Prices include your room, all meals and airport transfers. We looking forward to sharing this special day with you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Save the date insert.bmp\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/686906\/width\/459\/height\/361\" style=\"width: 327px; height: 258px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Information on our Website&lt;\/strong&gt; - For some reason, people have been confused when contacting my travel agent for pricing. A lot of people do not travel much and did not understand the prices were based on double occupancy and airfare was included (which would be very expensive as we are 10 months out!). So to help everyone I did some research and put the following on our wedding website.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;TRAVEL ARRANGEMENTS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;Arrangements and accommodations should be made directly with TRAVEL AGENT NAME of TRAVEL COMPANY. In order to keep our group travel plans coordinated we encourage you to contact Nancy at your earliest convenience for discounted pricing and availability.  &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;TRAVEL AGENT NAME&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 32, 96);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;webstite\n Phone (XXX) XXX-XXX\n travel agent email address&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;RESORT: AZUL SENSATORI&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;Make sure you reserve your room as soon as possible. You can reserve it for a low deposit of $50 per person (for land only). Balance due 45 days before departure. Contact Nancy Finn to coordinate the dates that best fit your needs. Prices include your room, all meals, all drinks, airport transfers and taxes. Sample rates below. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;   &lt;u&gt;Travel Dates: October 11th - 15th&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;\t   1 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXX\n \t   2 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXX per person, total of $XXXX\n \t   3 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXXper person, total of $XXXX\n \t   4 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Oceanview Suite) $XXX per person, total of $XXXX&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;\t\t Insurance is an extra $XX per person&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;AIR&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;There are many options for airfare. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;1. You can obtain airfare with your hotel reservation from TRAVEL AGENT NAME. You do not have to book the airfare right away, it can be added at a later time.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;2. You can obtain your own airfare on websites like orbitz.com, expedia.com, kayak.com, etc....&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;3. You can obtain airfare directly from the airlines on their websites aa.com, united.com, etc... Or discount airlines like spiritairlines.com, jetblue.com, airtran.com, etc...&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;4. You can use your credit card points to purchase airfare\n Check out some credit cards with great travel points: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.creditcards.com\/reward.php\"&gt;CREDIT CARDS&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;Our favorite credit card is offering 50,000 bonus points: &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"https:\/\/creditcards.chase.com\/sapphire\/credit-cards\/sapphire-preferred-card\"&gt;CHASE SAPPHIRE PREFFERED&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;Please note: airlines don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t start releasing cheaper seats until 3-5 months before departure date. Click on the following link for tips on how to find the lowest cost airfare: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.independenttraveler.com\/travel-tips\/air-travel\/tips-for-finding-cheap-airfare\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;TIPS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;ALTERNATE RESORT&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;Please be advised that if you decide to stay at a different resort there is a Day Pass Fee:  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;October 11, 2012 - If you are planning on attending the rehersal, dinner rehersal and\/or welcome reception you will have to pay $80 per person for a Day Pass, which covers food and activities for 8 hours.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;October 12, 2012 - Our Wedding Day. We were able to get the Day Pass Fee waived.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p align=\"center\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:11px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153);\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif;\"&gt;We looking forward to sharing this special day with you!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570240,"PostDate":1326972379,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\">My wedding is not until October 12, 2012 but I am a planner. I have been searching around for wording for many things as I like to do a lot of my projects. So I scoured the internet and want to share what I found so that other brides can save time. I will keep adding new items as my planning progresses. If anyone has any other wording that they would like to share, that would be appreciated!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Save the Date Inserts<\/strong> - Along with my save the date magnets, I included information about travel arrangements. I did not want it to be too lengthy.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#ff3399\">Arrangements and accommodations should be made directly with TRAVEL AGENT NAME of TRAVEL COMPANY. In order to keep our group travel plans coordinated we encourage you to contact Nancy at your earliest convenience for\u00a0 discounted pricing and availability.\u00a0 A nominal deposit can be placed to hold your room. Prices include your room, all meals and airport transfers. We looking forward to sharing this special day with you!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Save the date insert.bmp\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/686906\/width\/459\/height\/361\" style=\"width: 327px; height: 258px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Travel Information on our Website<\/strong> - For some reason, people have been confused when contacting my travel agent for pricing. A lot of people do not travel much and did not understand the prices were based on double occupancy and airfare was included (which would be very expensive as we are 10 months out!). So to help everyone I did some research and put the following on our wedding website.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">TRAVEL ARRANGEMENTS<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">Arrangements and accommodations should be made directly with TRAVEL AGENT NAME of TRAVEL COMPANY. In order to keep our group travel plans coordinated we encourage you to contact Nancy at your earliest convenience for discounted pricing and availability.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 32, 96)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">TRAVEL AGENT NAME<\/span><\/span><\/strong><br \/> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 32, 96)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">webstite<br \/> Phone (XXX) XXX-XXX<br \/> travel agent email address<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">RESORT: AZUL SENSATORI<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">Make sure you reserve your room as soon as possible. You can reserve it for a low deposit of $50 per person (for land only). Balance due 45 days before departure. Contact Nancy Finn to coordinate the dates that best fit your needs. Prices include your room, all meals, all drinks, airport transfers and taxes. Sample rates below. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">\u00a0\u00a0 <u>Travel Dates: October 11th - 15th<\/u><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 1 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXX<br \/> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 2 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXX per person, total of $XXXX<br \/> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 3 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Suite) $XXXper person, total of $XXXX<br \/> \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 4 person room (Luxury Jacuzzi Oceanview Suite) $XXX per person, total of $XXXX<\/span><\/span><br \/> <span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><em><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Insurance is an extra $XX per person<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">AIR<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">There are many options for airfare. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">1. You can obtain airfare with your hotel reservation from TRAVEL AGENT NAME. You do not have to book the airfare right away, it can be added at a later time.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\">2. You can obtain your own airfare on websites like orbitz.com, expedia.com, kayak.com, etc....<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\">3. You can obtain airfare directly from the airlines on their websites aa.com, united.com, etc... Or discount airlines like spiritairlines.com, jetblue.com, airtran.com, etc...<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\">4. You can use your credit card points to purchase airfare<br \/> Check out some credit cards with great travel points: <\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><a href='http:\/\/www.creditcards.com\/reward.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>CREDIT CARDS<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/span><br \/> <span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\">Our favorite credit card is offering 50,000 bonus points: <\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\"><a href='https:\/\/creditcards.chase.com\/sapphire\/credit-cards\/sapphire-preferred-card' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>CHASE SAPPHIRE PREFFERED<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">Please note: airlines don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t start releasing cheaper seats until 3-5 months before departure date. Click on the following link for tips on how to find the lowest cost airfare: <a href='http:\/\/www.independenttraveler.com\/travel-tips\/air-travel\/tips-for-finding-cheap-airfare' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">TIPS<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">ALTERNATE RESORT<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">Please be advised that if you decide to stay at a different resort there is a Day Pass Fee:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">October 11, 2012 - If you are planning on attending the rehersal, dinner rehersal and\/or welcome reception you will have to pay $80 per person for a Day Pass, which covers food and activities for 8 hours.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">October 12, 2012 - Our Wedding Day. We were able to get the Day Pass Fee waived.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p align=\"center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:11px\"><strong><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial,sans-serif\">We looking forward to sharing this special day with you!<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":13124