55b88b981","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love the STD &amp;amp; the wording! &amp;nbsp;I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD&#039;s, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580222,"PostDate":1328776656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love the STD & the wording! \u00a0I have been stumbling around trying to get different programs written out before putting together the STD's, so this will be very helpful - thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenni.chambers@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1318296193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246522.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nimbleknits","Id":246522,"Name":"nimbleknits","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9115b8ba58633dea7c781d32014ebfb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks! I created the Save the Dates on vistaprint.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580239,"PostDate":1328780865,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks! I created the Save the Dates on vistaprint.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33c66772e08239fa07c1a80d9fcb9b04","RawContent":"Love the wording!","Attachments":[],"Id":1592349,"PostDate":1331246164,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love the wording!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"realcdngirl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330442869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252057.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Realcdngirl","Id":252057,"Name":"Realcdngirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2743dd355503db1eefe317cdebf3d95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITINERARY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am having the hotel provide an itinerary sheet to each guest as they check in. My fiance and I are ever so greatful for those who will be able to attend our wedding. I found the following Thank You paragraph that I added to the itinerary.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;address&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #ff0099\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: bell mt\"&gt;\"TO OUR FAMILY AND FRIENDS, THANK YOU. IT MEANS&amp;nbsp;THE WORLD TO US TO HAVE YOU HERE. THANK YOU FOR BEING OUR SUPPORT SYSTEM. OUR ENCOURAGEMENT. OUR PARTNERS IN CRIME. FOR LOVING US THROUGH THE UPS AND DOWNS IN LIFE. FOR BEING OUR MENTORS, THEACHERS, AND GUIDES. FORVER GRATEFUL YOU ARE OUR FAVORITE PEOPLE IN THE WORLD AND WE LOVE YOU.\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/address&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Itinerary for guests.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/753290\/width\/541\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 424px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592452,"PostDate":1331286897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <u><strong>ITINERARY<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> I am having the hotel provide an itinerary sheet to each guest as they check in. My fiance and I are ever so greatful for those who will be able to attend our wedding. I found the following Thank You paragraph that I added to the itinerary.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <address> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"color: #ff0099\"><span  style=\"font-family: bell mt\">\"TO OUR FAMILY AND FRIENDS, THANK YOU. IT MEANS\u00a0THE WORLD TO US TO HAVE YOU HERE. THANK YOU FOR BEING OUR SUPPORT SYSTEM. OUR ENCOURAGEMENT. OUR PARTNERS IN CRIME. FOR LOVING US THROUGH THE UPS AND DOWNS IN LIFE. FOR BEING OUR MENTORS, THEACHERS, AND GUIDES. FORVER GRATEFUL YOU ARE OUR FAVORITE PEOPLE IN THE WORLD AND WE LOVE YOU.\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/address> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Itinerary for guests.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/753290\/width\/541\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 424px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c8260cea1925b3933df029c623dda9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Jsal, these look great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592520,"PostDate":1331297135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Jsal, these look great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303572912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7382a5a4f0a805c15bb920be718075e6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; great job! Love the paragraphy for the itinerary!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592532,"PostDate":1331298065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> great job! Love the paragraphy for the itinerary!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294245874,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19dc19d3ef47ef82d4a722706a1d2f20","RawContent":"The wording and design on this is amazing. Super cute.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jsal4[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [u][b]ITINERARY[\/b][\/u] \n I am having the hotel provide an itinerary sheet to each guest as they check in. My fiance and I are ever so greatful for those who will be able to attend our wedding. I found the following Thank You paragraph that I added to the itinerary. \n  [size=4][color=#FF0099][font=bell mt]\"TO OUR FAMILY AND FRIENDS, THANK YOU. IT MEANS THE WORLD TO US TO HAVE YOU HERE. THANK YOU FOR BEING OUR SUPPORT SYSTEM. OUR ENCOURAGEMENT. OUR PARTNERS IN CRIME. FOR LOVING US THROUGH THE UPS AND DOWNS IN LIFE. FOR BEING OUR MENTORS, THEACHERS, AND GUIDES. FORVER GRATEFUL YOU ARE OUR FAVORITE PEOPLE IN THE WORLD AND WE LOVE YOU.\"[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n \n \n\n[center] [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/753290\/width\/541\/height\/700[\/img][\/center][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1593764,"PostDate":1331579223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The wording and design on this is amazing. Super cute.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jsal4<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <u><strong>ITINERARY<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> I am having the hotel provide an itinerary sheet to each guest as they check in. My fiance and I are ever so greatful for those who will be able to attend our wedding. I found the following Thank You paragraph that I added to the itinerary.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <address> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 153)\"><span  style=\"font-family: bell mt\">\"TO OUR FAMILY AND FRIENDS, THANK YOU. IT MEANS\u00a0THE WORLD TO US TO HAVE YOU HERE. THANK YOU FOR BEING OUR SUPPORT SYSTEM. OUR ENCOURAGEMENT. OUR PARTNERS IN CRIME. FOR LOVING US THROUGH THE UPS AND DOWNS IN LIFE. FOR BEING OUR MENTORS, THEACHERS, AND GUIDES. FORVER GRATEFUL YOU ARE OUR FAVORITE PEOPLE IN THE WORLD AND WE LOVE YOU.\"<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/address> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Itinerary for guests.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/753290\/width\/541\/height\/700\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 424px;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Wedding booked for December 12, 2012 at the RIU Ocho Rio....cannot wait.....it will be the best day of our lives<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"k.imrie@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1283372980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231967.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristy28","Id":231967,"Name":"Kristy28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8376d0f39982294237c9a6f8f619a415","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;I have designed and ordered my invitations. I love vistaprint.com! My 100 invites cost less than $50. If you find the right coupon code for this website you can save soooo much money. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;I did not want to have response cards. Most of my friends and family are technology savvy and if they are not, I know they know how to use a phone. I spoke to a lot of my friends who had gotten married and they said a lot of their RSVP cards were never returned. They ended up having to contact the guests who did not response. I figured, since I am going to have to do that anyways then why not start by having them RSVP by email, text or phone. Saves money on RSVP cards and postage.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; Here is what I wrote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;We look forward to celebrating with you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;Please RSVP by August 12, 2012 via&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;EMAIL: XXXXXXXXX@hotmail.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;PHONE\/TEXT:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Josephine (000) 000-0000&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Kurt (000) 000-0000&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"InviteFront.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823616\/width\/404\/height\/627\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 460px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  I am ever so grateful to those who are joining us and did not want them to get us a present. I searched and searched and then combined some sentence I liked. This is the back of the invitation.  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;About Gifts&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;The very best present we can receive is your presence at our wedding and your love and support as we embark on this adventure together. Many of you are contributing your time and energy to this event, and for the gift of your participation we thank you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;To make it easier for the more traditional gift givers among you, we have set up a registry on www.bedbathbeyond.com and&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"&gt;www.honeyfund.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Invite2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823618\/width\/415\/height\/632\" style=\"width: 324px; height: 492px;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1617757,"PostDate":1336557196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size:12px\">I have designed and ordered my invitations. I love vistaprint.com! My 100 invites cost less than $50. If you find the right coupon code for this website you can save soooo much money. <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:12px\">I did not want to have response cards. Most of my friends and family are technology savvy and if they are not, I know they know how to use a phone. I spoke to a lot of my friends who had gotten married and they said a lot of their RSVP cards were never returned. They ended up having to contact the guests who did not response. I figured, since I am going to have to do that anyways then why not start by having them RSVP by email, text or phone. Saves money on RSVP cards and postage.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> Here is what I wrote:<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">We look forward to celebrating with you.<\/span><\/p> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">Please RSVP by August 12, 2012 via<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">EMAIL: XXXXXXXXX@hotmail.com<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">PHONE\/TEXT:<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Josephine (000) 000-0000<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">\u00e2\u20ac\u00a2 Kurt (000) 000-0000<\/span><\/div>  \u00a0 <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"InviteFront.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823616\/width\/404\/height\/627\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 460px;\" \/><\/span><\/div>  \u00a0  I am ever so grateful to those who are joining us and did not want them to get us a present. I searched and searched and then combined some sentence I liked. This is the back of the invitation.  \u00a0  <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">About Gifts<\/span> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">The very best present we can receive is your presence at our wedding and your love and support as we embark on this adventure together. Many of you are contributing your time and energy to this event, and for the gift of your participation we thank you.<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">To make it easier for the more traditional gift givers among you, we have set up a registry on www.bedbathbeyond.com and<\/span><\/div> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"color:#ff0099\">www.honeyfund.com<\/span><\/p> <\/div> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Invite2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823618\/width\/415\/height\/632\" style=\"width: 324px; height: 492px;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312471536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":48,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
