{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64860,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bd04940a3a52f073b75ef2b2458fa10","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"BDW_visa_GC_large_cropped_250.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/806345\/width\/407\/height\/298\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We would love to interview you and feature you and your wedding on BDW. &amp;nbsp;We would need you to thoroughly answer our questions as well as provide as much planning and wedding pics as you can.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; we would love to feature 2 weddings\/brides a month.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; if you are interested in participating, please let me know here.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; At the end of the year we will chose 1 bride that was featured and give them a $250 (either in the form of a giftcard or paypal!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is open to all BDW members (vendors, mods included!) &amp;nbsp;spread the word to other brides!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This interview and feature will be posted here on BDW and may be sent out in the newsletter!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h2&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Here are some past Featured Brides:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/806345\/width\/407\/height\/298\/flags\/LL\"&gt;Jessica @ Aventura Cove&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/miriam-and-luke-wedding-at-azul-sensatori\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miriam @ Azul Sensatori&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/rashedah-and-torry-wedding-at-iberostar-rosehall-beach-resort-jamaica\"&gt;Rashedah @ Iberostar Rose Hall&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/shawn-trisha-gran-bahia-principe-akumal-wedding-in-riviera-maya\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shawn @ Gran Bahia Principe&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/stephanie-and-keith-get-married-at-mission-de-san-jose-del-cabo-anuniti\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stephanie @ Missions De San Jose del Cabo Anuniti&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/cortney-and-michael-wedding-at-paradisus-punta-cana-dominican-republic\"&gt;Cortney @ Paradisus Punta Cana&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/stephanie-and-john-get-married-at-atlantis-paradise-island\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stephanie @ Atlantis Paradise Island&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/carnival-liberty-eastern-caribbean-wedding\"&gt;Erica @ Carnival Liberty Eastern &amp;nbsp;Caribbean Cruise&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/grand-sirenis-wedding-for-janette-and-colin\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Janette @ Grand Sirenis Akumal&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -----------------------------------------&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#b22222;\"&gt;Ok, here is how to submit your application to be a&lt;strong&gt; FEATURED BDW WEDDING!&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/messages.php\"&gt;PM Me (Tammy Host) &lt;\/a&gt;with the following&lt;u&gt; AFTER&lt;\/u&gt; YOU HAVE GOTTEN MARRIED with the subject line \"&lt;span style=\"color:#800000;\"&gt;BDW Featured wedding application&lt;\/span&gt;\":&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Bride &amp;amp; Groom name&lt;\/strong&gt; (If you do not feel comfortable with your full name, first names are fine):&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;BDW Username&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Wedding Date&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Hometown&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Wedding Location&lt;\/strong&gt; (Resort Name, Villa Name, City &amp;amp; Country):&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This part should be 1-2 paragraphs answers for each question.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Why did you choose to have a destination wedding?&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Why did you choose your location?&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Colors and\/or theme?&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;What made your wedding special? &amp;nbsp;or what makes your relationship special?&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Vendor list:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;Photog, florist, wedding coordinator, wedding dress designer, invitation company, etc.&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; Links to related bdw reviews? or buy, sell, trade listings?&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;strong&gt;Please include a picture of you and your new husband (wife) and other pictures including of location and wedding details.&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks again!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1557459,"PostDate":1323976730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"BDW_visa_GC_large_cropped_250.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/806345\/width\/407\/height\/298\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We would love to interview you and feature you and your wedding on BDW. \u00a0We would need you to thoroughly answer our questions as well as provide as much planning and wedding pics as you can.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> we would love to feature 2 weddings\/brides a month.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> if you are interested in participating, please let me know here.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> At the end of the year we will chose 1 bride that was featured and give them a $250 (either in the form of a giftcard or paypal!)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is open to all BDW members (vendors, mods included!) \u00a0spread the word to other brides!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This interview and feature will be posted here on BDW and may be sent out in the newsletter!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <h2> <strong>Here are some past Featured Brides:<\/strong><\/h2> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/806345\/width\/407\/height\/298\/flags\/LL' class='bbc_url' title=''>Jessica @ Aventura Cove<\/a><\/strong><\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/miriam-and-luke-wedding-at-azul-sensatori' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Miriam @ Azul Sensatori<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/rashedah-and-torry-wedding-at-iberostar-rosehall-beach-resort-jamaica' class='bbc_url' title=''>Rashedah @ Iberostar Rose Hall<\/a><\/strong><\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/shawn-trisha-gran-bahia-principe-akumal-wedding-in-riviera-maya' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Shawn @ Gran Bahia Principe<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/stephanie-and-keith-get-married-at-mission-de-san-jose-del-cabo-anuniti' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Stephanie @ Missions De San Jose del Cabo Anuniti<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/cortney-and-michael-wedding-at-paradisus-punta-cana-dominican-republic' class='bbc_url' title=''>Cortney @ Paradisus Punta Cana<\/a><\/strong><\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/stephanie-and-john-get-married-at-atlantis-paradise-island' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Stephanie @ Atlantis Paradise Island<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/carnival-liberty-eastern-caribbean-wedding' class='bbc_url' title=''>Erica @ Carnival Liberty Eastern \u00a0Caribbean Cruise<\/a><\/strong><\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/a\/grand-sirenis-wedding-for-janette-and-colin' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Janette @ Grand Sirenis Akumal<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -----------------------------------------<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#b22222\">Ok, here is how to submit your application to be a<strong> FEATURED BDW WEDDING!<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/messages.php' class='bbc_url' title=''>PM Me (Tammy Host) <\/a>with the following<u> AFTER<\/u> YOU HAVE GOTTEN MARRIED with the subject line \"<span  style=\"color:#800000\">BDW Featured wedding application<\/span>\":<\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <ul> <li> <strong>Bride & Groom name<\/strong> (If you do not feel comfortable with your full name, first names are fine):<\/li> <li> <strong>BDW Username<\/strong>:<\/li> <li> <strong>Wedding Date<\/strong>:<\/li> <li> <strong>Hometown<\/strong>:<\/li> <li> <strong>Wedding Location<\/strong> (Resort Name, Villa Name, City & Country):<\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This part should be 1-2 paragraphs answers for each question.<\/p> <ul> <li> <strong>Why did you choose to have a destination wedding?<\/strong><\/li> <li> <strong>Why did you choose your location?<\/strong><\/li> <li> <strong>Colors and\/or theme?<\/strong><\/li> <li> <strong>What made your wedding special? \u00a0or what makes your relationship special?<\/strong><\/li> <li> <strong>Vendor list:\u00a0<\/strong>Photog, florist, wedding coordinator, wedding dress designer, invitation company, etc.<\/li> <\/ul>  \u00a0 <ul> <li> Links to related bdw reviews? or buy, sell, trade listings?<\/li> <\/ul>  \u00a0  <strong>Please include a picture of you and your new husband (wife) and other pictures including of location and wedding details.<\/strong> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\