e,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a57fa9d8d46e29e600c66a4ae674b9e5","RawContent":"I just trying searching for chair sashes but I&#039;m coming up empty so I need some help!\n \n I&#039;m planning on making chair sashes in our wedding colour. How long should they be though? And do certain fabrics work better? Should I use stiffer fabric or something flimsy?","Attachments":[],"Id":426793,"PostDate":1219348783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just trying searching for chair sashes but I'm coming up empty so I need some help!<br \/> <br \/> I'm planning on making chair sashes in our wedding colour. How long should they be though? And do certain fabrics work better? Should I use stiffer fabric or something flimsy?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;116\/st\/20081028\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/bf25\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bf25\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amandacave@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1202350348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208496.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RyanAmanda","Id":208496,"Name":"RyanAmanda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"911323659663c791753c245debf3e229","RawContent":"Most of them are at least 72&amp;quot; (6 ft) others are 96&amp;quot; (8 ft).\n \n Widths will also vary between 6 and 12 inches.\n \n The size and fabric will depend on your final look. The longer they are, the larger the bow or longer the tails.\n \n If you use a soft fabric like chiffon, the bows will be really limp. Satin can be shaped as can a starched organza.\n \n I hope that helped! LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":426816,"PostDate":1219349417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Most of them are at least 72\" (6 ft) others are 96\" (8 ft).<br \/> <br \/> Widths will also vary between 6 and 12 inches.<br \/> <br \/> The size and fabric will depend on your final look. The longer they are, the larger the bow or longer the tails.<br \/> <br \/> If you use a soft fabric like chiffon, the bows will be really limp. Satin can be shaped as can a starched organza.<br \/> <br \/> I hope that helped! LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/blogs\/erinb\">Visit My BDW Blog!<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/21100-couples-swept-away-review-insanely-long-and-detailed\/\">My CSA Wedding Review<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/20334-erinbs-csa-pro-pics-better-late-than-never\/\">Wedding Pictures<\/a><\/strong> & <strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/20335-erinbs-ttd-pic-heavy\/\">My TTD<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/18150-erinbs-planning-thread\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n","Email":"arynn2@aol.com","IpAddress":"74.138.76.73","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1196792400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208007.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ErinB","Id":208007,"Name":"ErinB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79ad87d8bfaa59ad9e6be1e66aa69316","RawContent":"I plan on bringing my own chair bows as well. I just bought 6&amp;quot; wide organza ribbon and am planning on using that. You can find many colors on e-bay or if you just do a search on google or yahoo. They also have this in 6&amp;quot; or 12&amp;quot; in tulle. I thought this would be much simplier than trying to sew satin. It is also very economical compared to renting them at your destination.","Attachments":[],"Id":428381,"PostDate":1219458914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I plan on bringing my own chair bows as well. I just bought 6\" wide organza ribbon and am planning on using that. You can find many colors on e-bay or if you just do a search on google or yahoo. They also have this in 6\" or 12\" in tulle. I thought this would be much simplier than trying to sew satin. It is also very economical compared to renting them at your destination.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;405\/st\/20090110\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/08a3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...08a3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ajahnal@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1209092397,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209189.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":63,"PhotoHeight":96,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Beach Bride 80","Id":209189,"Name":"Beach Bride 80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.98.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":22346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70558a61d0d9c001181889be19a7f97c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;6 inch x 106 inches or 8 inch x 108 inches sizes are available. take one. it will useful to you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901078,"PostDate":1437716735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>6 inch x 106 inches or 8 inch x 108 inches sizes are available. take one. it will useful to you<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Chair Sashes, Chair Covers, Organza and Satin Bags Supplier in United States. Tulle Fabric and Ribbons.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.cawraps.com'>www.cawraps.com<\/a>","Email":"joliebrad20@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.98.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437715467,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"joliebrad20","Id":284110,"Name":"joliebrad20","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"22346","Title":"How long are chair sashes?","LastPostDate":1437716735},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
