Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":95,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":20147,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1766346,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1370858864,"LastPoster":{"Id":283868,"Name":"Kendia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1766346,"PostDate":1370858864,"PostContent":"Even though my wedding isn't until next year, our travel agent secured a great deal for our gues...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":8,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58eb5ad4bfc401ab37a4d8414e8cbf1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Even though my wedding isn&#039;t until next year, our travel agent secured a great deal for our guests to travel to Puerto Vallarta with us next year. Due to that fact, my invites are being sent out a month after the STD&#039;s went out! Every puts down their deposit by end August, and pays by January. yes, we are asking people to commit very early.... but if they choose not to use our TA, and get flights\/ accommodations on their own, they are risking a major price increase! We know it is a lot to ask, but such is our reality for our wedding it seems!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Without further delay, here are my boarding pass invites!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I hope, I hope I give credit to all the right people for this!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;I borrowed with love templates from:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - boarding pass template: foxytv&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - boarding pass INSPIRATION: ChocoTaco &amp;amp; multiple other brides posts&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - jacket template: ???? (will give post credit when I find out where I took it from!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Letter to family &amp;amp; Friends: ChocoTaco&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - boarding pass \"not a valid travel voucher\"- Aylee Bits&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fonts Used (downloaded from DaFont or came with the template):&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; wmtrees1&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; CalifornianFB&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Organic Elements&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Scriptina&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Port Credit&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Breakdown:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (purchased a lot of things new, that I will be using again for other projects)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paper&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; (ordered online from Paper Garden- AMAZING CANADIAN SITE!)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Basis Aqua cardstock- 30 pages- $13.50&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; AURA Eggplant cardstock- 10 pages (ordered 70)- $4.20&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cougar White Cardstock- 50 pages (ordered 100)- $8.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Aura Eggplant No.10 Envelopes- 50 per package- $21.33&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Return Address Labels- previous Vista Print purchase&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Envelope Seal stickers- previous Vista Print purchase&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cutterbee- Michaels (on sale!)- $19.99&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Perforator- Walmart- $3.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Scorer- Walmart- $3.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Raffia- Walmart- $1.97&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Round Punch- Walmart- $4.97&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hand Punch Hole Punch- Michaels (50% off coupon)- $5.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Crystal Brads- Michaels- $4.99&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Glue Dots- Michaels (50% off coupon)- $4.25&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Printing:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; $49.47 at PostNet&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stamps:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; (had a previous roll of Canadian stamps that my mom gave me) $0&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - need to get American Stamps though- so estimated cost of those is $20.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Cost is: $163.67 (for 30 invites)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Alright, now for the fun stuff! Pictures and templates!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207351\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207351\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207352\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207352\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_3376\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_4110\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207372\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207372\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; All fully cut (took about 3 hours, and then cutting the indents was SUUUPPPPER fun)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207374\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; In the middle of rounding the corners.... amazing how different they look!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207375\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; ALL DONE!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207376\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207376\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; These took me two evenings of work. First I scored them, then folded the next day.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207377\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; Putting these together took me an entire evening (like 6 hours). So time consuming to properly cut, measure, and put together.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207378\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207379\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207380\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207381\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207382\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; The first 3 pages have this on the back of them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207383\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; The return ticket has this on the back. The ones going to the states don&#039;t have a return postage though.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207384\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207385\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; I want to send out a HUGE thank you to ChocoTaco! Your invites were a HUGE inspiration to me, and when I read this, I just knew I had to do something similar. I used a couple lines from yours, in which you explain how life has limitations, and you understand if people cannot make it. I tired to re-write it, but your writing was absolutely perfect. THANK YOU for posting your invite, because it made making mine sooo much easier!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207388\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207388\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207389\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; All done and ready to be sent out! The ones out of the box are the ones being mailed to the States- I have to get stamps for them still.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Templates!&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (I saved all files as a PDF in order to print them without losing the formatting)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I combined these two files into a PDF to print them.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13972&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;boarding pass Invites.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;91&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13974&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;not a valid travel voucher.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207390\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207391\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207391\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13973&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Invite RSVP pass.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;32&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207392\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207393\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207393\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_2826\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13976&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Jacket Letter.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;39&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_8456\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207394\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207394\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13977&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;logo multi.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;29&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I made my logo using this post: &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207395\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207395\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;13978&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Outside_jacket_with_airplane[1].pptx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;38&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pptx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_9929\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"207396\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207396\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope you all enjoy!!!!\n &amp;nbsp;Let you know the responses I receive from my guests as I get them in &lt;span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_10586\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_10585\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1766346,"PostDate":1370858864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Even though my wedding isn't until next year, our travel agent secured a great deal for our guests to travel to Puerto Vallarta with us next year. Due to that fact, my invites are being sent out a month after the STD's went out! Every puts down their deposit by end August, and pays by January. yes, we are asking people to commit very early.... but if they choose not to use our TA, and get flights\/ accommodations on their own, they are risking a major price increase! We know it is a lot to ask, but such is our reality for our wedding it seems!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Without further delay, here are my boarding pass invites!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I hope, I hope I give credit to all the right people for this!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u>I borrowed with love templates from:<\/u><\/strong><\/p> <p> - boarding pass template: foxytv<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> - boarding pass INSPIRATION: ChocoTaco & multiple other brides posts<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> - jacket template: ???? (will give post credit when I find out where I took it from!)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> - Letter to family & Friends: ChocoTaco<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> - boarding pass \"not a valid travel voucher\"- Aylee Bits<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Fonts Used (downloaded from DaFont or came with the template):<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> wmtrees1<\/p> <p> CalifornianFB<\/p> <p> Organic Elements<\/p> <p> Scriptina<\/p> <p> Port Credit<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><strong>Cost Breakdown:<\/strong><\/u><\/span><\/p> <p> (purchased a lot of things new, that I will be using again for other projects)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Paper<\/strong><\/u> (ordered online from Paper Garden- AMAZING CANADIAN SITE!)<\/p> <p> Basis Aqua cardstock- 30 pages- $13.50<\/p> <p> AURA Eggplant cardstock- 10 pages (ordered 70)- $4.20<\/p> <p> Cougar White Cardstock- 50 pages (ordered 100)- $8.00<\/p> <p> Aura Eggplant No.10 Envelopes- 50 per package- $21.33<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Return Address Labels- previous Vista Print purchase<\/p> <p> Envelope Seal stickers- previous Vista Print purchase<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Tools:<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> Cutterbee- Michaels (on sale!)- $19.99<\/p> <p> Perforator- Walmart- $3.00<\/p> <p> Scorer- Walmart- $3.00<\/p> <p> Raffia- Walmart- $1.97<\/p> <p> Round Punch- Walmart- $4.97<\/p> <p> Hand Punch Hole Punch- Michaels (50% off coupon)- $5.00<\/p> <p> Crystal Brads- Michaels- $4.99<\/p> <p> Glue Dots- Michaels (50% off coupon)- $4.25<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Printing:<\/strong><\/u> $49.47 at PostNet<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u><strong>Stamps:<\/strong><\/u> (had a previous roll of Canadian stamps that my mom gave me) $0<\/p> <p> - need to get American Stamps though- so estimated cost of those is $20.00<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><strong>Total Cost is: $163.67 (for 30 invites)<\/strong><\/em><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Alright, now for the fun stuff! Pictures and templates!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207351\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207351\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207352\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207352\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_3376\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_4110\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207372\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207372\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> All fully cut (took about 3 hours, and then cutting the indents was SUUUPPPPER fun)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207374\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207374\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> In the middle of rounding the corners.... amazing how different they look!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207375\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207375\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> ALL DONE!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207376\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207376\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> These took me two evenings of work. First I scored them, then folded the next day.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207377\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207377\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> Putting these together took me an entire evening (like 6 hours). So time consuming to properly cut, measure, and put together.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207378\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207378\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207379\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207379\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207380\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207380\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207381\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207381\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207382\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207382\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> The first 3 pages have this on the back of them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207383\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207383\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> The return ticket has this on the back. The ones going to the states don't have a return postage though.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207384\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207384\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207385\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207385\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> I want to send out a HUGE thank you to ChocoTaco! Your invites were a HUGE inspiration to me, and when I read this, I just knew I had to do something similar. I used a couple lines from yours, in which you explain how life has limitations, and you understand if people cannot make it. I tired to re-write it, but your writing was absolutely perfect. THANK YOU for posting your invite, because it made making mine sooo much easier!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207388\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207388\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207389\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207389\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> All done and ready to be sent out! The ones out of the box are the ones being mailed to the States- I have to get stamps for them still.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><u>Templates!<\/u><\/strong><\/p> <p> (I saved all files as a PDF in order to print them without losing the formatting)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I combined these two files into a PDF to print them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13972\",\"name\":\"boarding pass Invites.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"91\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13974\",\"name\":\"not a valid travel voucher.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"24\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207390\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207390\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207391\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207391\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13973\",\"name\":\"Invite RSVP pass.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"32\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207392\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207392\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207393\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207393\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_2826\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13976\",\"name\":\"Jacket Letter.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"39\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_8456\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207394\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207394\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13977\",\"name\":\"logo multi.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"29\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I made my logo using this post: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207395\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207395\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"13978\",\"name\":\"Outside_jacket_with_airplane[1].pptx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"38\",\"type\":\"pptx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_9929\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"207396\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/207396\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope you all enjoy!!!!<br \/> \u00a0Let you know the responses I receive from my guests as I get them in <span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_10586\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1370867284445_10585\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74238,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa60970590547a74923f2cd50210028f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love these! You did a fantastic job.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1766761,"PostDate":1370946228,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love these! You did a fantastic job.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dubhreubel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.52.246.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369122651,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269805.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":