Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":15,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":2999,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1809751,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":265472,"Name":"ucfjennifer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1382819068,"LastPoster":{"Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1809751,"PostDate":1382819068,"PostContent":"There are so many fun ideas on this board and I really appreciate all of the brides before me tha...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenandcasey2014@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.47.3.153","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359678677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ucfjennifer","Id":265472,"Name":"ucfjennifer","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75454,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4c6c7a4901869fd8e6797ca5d2452ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;There are so many fun ideas on this board and I really appreciate all of the brides before me that have posted their DIY threads!&amp;nbsp; I have received so many great ideas and motivation to attempt a few of my own.&amp;nbsp; I never considered myself a very creative person,&amp;nbsp;but this has been a really fun experience.  I decided on a&amp;nbsp;boarding pass invite that incorporated the cover to provide additional information.&amp;nbsp; In the end, these cost me a little over $1 each&amp;nbsp;(excluding postage).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Materials:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;1) &amp;nbsp;8.5\" x 11\" white cardstock (Michael&#039;s)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;2) &amp;nbsp;8.5\" x 11\" silver metallic cardstock (Cards &amp;amp; Pockets)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;3) &amp;nbsp;Metallic mailing envelopes (Cards &amp;amp; Pockets)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;4)&amp;nbsp; Metallic RSVP envelopes (Cards &amp;amp; Pockets)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instructions:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;1)&amp;nbsp; This is my&amp;nbsp;boarding pass insert.&amp;nbsp; I provided the basic ceremony information and added our wedding website.&amp;nbsp; The template will print 3 inserts on each sheet of white cardstock.&amp;nbsp; I printed the back side first and then the front.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224756\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224756\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;2)  This is my&amp;nbsp;RSVP card.&amp;nbsp; This template will also&amp;nbsp;print 3 inserts on each sheet of white cardstock.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224760\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224760\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;3)&amp;nbsp; This is&amp;nbsp;one side of the silver metallic&amp;nbsp;cover&amp;nbsp;that will later be folded.&amp;nbsp; I printed this side first.&amp;nbsp; Our passport save the dates said \"passport to paradise\" so the \"ticket to paradise\" was a great continuation of the theme.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224759\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224759\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;4)&amp;nbsp; And here is the other side that has our cruise itinerary and booking information.  The ink&amp;nbsp;on the front side will smudge if you print right away, so I suggest waiting a bit before printing this&amp;nbsp;side of the cover.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224758\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224758\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;5)&amp;nbsp; After waiting for the ink to dry, I folded the bottom of the sheet a little less than a third of the way up.  I secured the upper right corner with a glue dot.&amp;nbsp; Then I cut a diagonal line from the bottom left corner.&amp;nbsp; Insert the boarding pass and RSVP card with envelope, then fold the top portion down.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224757\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224757\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I will post my templates in a few!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809751,"PostDate":1382819068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>There are so many fun ideas on this board and I really appreciate all of the brides before me that have posted their DIY threads!\u00a0 I have received so many great ideas and motivation to attempt a few of my own.\u00a0 I never considered myself a very creative person,\u00a0but this has been a really fun experience.\u00a0\u00a0I decided on a\u00a0boarding pass invite that incorporated the cover to provide additional information.\u00a0 In the end, these cost me a little over $1 each\u00a0(excluding postage).<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><strong>Materials:<\/strong><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>1) \u00a08.5\" x 11\" white cardstock (Michael's)<\/p> <p>2) \u00a08.5\" x 11\" silver metallic cardstock (Cards & Pockets)<\/p> <p>3) \u00a0Metallic mailing envelopes (Cards & Pockets)<\/p> <p>4)\u00a0 Metallic RSVP envelopes (Cards & Pockets)<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><strong>Instructions:<\/strong><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>1)\u00a0 This is my\u00a0boarding pass insert.\u00a0 I provided the basic ceremony information and added our wedding website.\u00a0 The template will print 3 inserts on each sheet of white cardstock.\u00a0 I printed the back side first and then the front.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224756\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224756\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>2)\u00a0\u00a0This is my\u00a0RSVP card.\u00a0 This template will also\u00a0print 3 inserts on each sheet of white cardstock.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224760\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224760\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>3)\u00a0 This is\u00a0one side of the silver metallic\u00a0cover\u00a0that will later be folded.\u00a0 I printed this side first.\u00a0 Our passport save the dates said \"passport to paradise\" so the \"ticket to paradise\" was a great continuation of the theme.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224759\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224759\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>4)\u00a0 And here is the other side that has our cruise itinerary and booking information.\u00a0\u00a0The ink\u00a0on the front side will smudge if you print right away, so I suggest waiting a bit before printing this\u00a0side of the cover.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224758\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224758\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>5)\u00a0 After waiting for the ink to dry, I folded the bottom of the sheet a little less than a third of the way up.\u00a0\u00a0I secured the upper right corner with a glue dot.\u00a0 Then I cut a diagonal line from the bottom left corner.\u00a0 Insert the boarding pass and RSVP card with envelope, then fold the top portion down.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224757\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224757\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I will post my templates in a few!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenandcasey2014@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.47.3.153","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359678677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ucfjennifer","Id":265472,"Name":"ucfjennifer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75454,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c69d8c273bd544730c03203387ef1b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Templates are attached!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:14462,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Boarding Pass.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;90&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:14463,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;RSVP.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;64&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:14464,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Cover.docx&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;35&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;docx&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809759,"PostDate":1382821635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Templates are attached!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":14462,\"name\":\"Boarding Pass.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"90\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":14463,\"name\":\"RSVP.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"64\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":14464,\"name\":\"Cover.docx\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"35\",\"type\":\"docx\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenandcasey2014@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.47.3.153","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359678677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ucfjennifer","Id":265472,"Name":"ucfjennifer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.35.146.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":tr