tml>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Like these a lot.\u00a0 Any idea if a laser printer can print on that paper?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"barbarabusybee@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.232.1.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403821429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278719.jpg?_r=1404077494","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BarbaraBusybee","Id":278719,"Name":"BarbaraBusybee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75454,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e796fa1626636017722ae5bbad65657d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love this idea&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857270,"PostDate":1403968332,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love this idea<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396387780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.23.131.118","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75454,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"699801011ee5609ae9396f0bca99019a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ucfjennifer\" post=\"1809759\" timestamp=\"1382836035\"]\nTemplates are attached!\n\n \n\n \n\n[\/quote][quote name=\"ucfjennifer\" post=\"1809759\" timestamp=\"1382836035\"]\nTemplates are attached!\n\n \n\n \n\n[\/quote]I don&#039;t see your templates :(... and they are exactly what I&#039;m looking for :(! Would you be so kind and attach them again or send me at zupochka@yahoo.com...I&#039;ll be forever greatful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1860703,"PostDate":1405690053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ucfjennifer, on 26 October 2013 - 09:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Templates are attached!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ucfjennifer, on 26 October 2013 - 09:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Templates are attached!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I don't see your templates <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>... and they are exactly what I'm looking for <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>! Would you be so kind and attach them again or send me at zupochka@yahoo.com...I'll be forever greatful!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"zupochka@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.23.131.118","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405349206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"zupochka","Id":279006,"Name":"zupochka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.54.94.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75454,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97089b10bc58ef1a78554f29d796ac27","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BarbaraBusybee\" post=\"1857181\" timestamp=\"1403894697\"]\nLike these a lot.  Any idea if a laser printer can print on that paper?[\/quote]\nI apologize for my delayed response!  Assuming you are asking about the metallic paper from Cards &amp;amp; Pockets...yes, i selected the \"text weight\" type of paper and recall it listing laser printing as one of the uses.  Also, on their website, there is an option to purchase a sample sheet for $1.10 with free shipping so you can try it out before purchasing a whole pack.\n[quote name=\"zupochka\" post=\"1860703\" timestamp=\"1405704453\"]\nI don&#039;t see your templates :(... and they are exactly what I&#039;m looking for :(! Would you be so kind and attach them again or send me at zupochka@yahoo.com...I&#039;ll be forever greatful![\/quote]\nSorry about that!  Trying again...hope it works!  I&#039;ve included two files...the boarding pass insert and the jacket cover.","Attachments":[],"Id":1860723,"PostDate":1405695462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BarbaraBusybee, on 27 June 2014 - 02:44 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Like these a lot.\u00a0 Any idea if a laser printer can print on that paper?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I apologize for my delayed response!\u00a0 Assuming you are asking about the metallic paper from Cards & Pockets...yes, i selected the \"text weight\" type of paper and recall it listing laser printing as one of the uses.\u00a0 Also, on their website, there is an option to purchase a sample sheet for $1.10 with free shipping so you can try it out\u00a0before purchasing a whole pack.<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:it