":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":51580,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d0a35e7c884980fcd285bc1d0ccf0ec","RawContent":"I completely forgot to included this in my planning thread!\n \n When I decided I wanted to send out a brochure I searched long and hard on this forum for a template I could use and couldn&#039;t find one for the life of me!\n \n *TIP - if you come across something you like on this forum, bookmark it! I didn&#039;t and had such a hard time finding those same things again!*\n \n Anyhoo - I finally took matters into my own hands and googled &amp;quot;how to make a brochure in Microsoft Word&amp;quot; and came across this website:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.computorcompanion.com\/LPMArticle.asp?ID=143\"&gt;Use Word to Create a Tri-Fold Brochure&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n It was super easy to do. Hope this is useful for you!&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7194&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Travel Brochure.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:317.5,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1139719,"PostDate":1273087204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I completely forgot to included this in my planning thread!<br \/> <br \/> When I decided I wanted to send out a brochure I searched long and hard on this forum for a template I could use and couldn't find one for the life of me!<br \/> <br \/> *TIP - if you come across something you like on this forum, bookmark it! I didn't and had such a hard time finding those same things again!*<br \/> <br \/> Anyhoo - I finally took matters into my own hands and googled \"how to make a brochure in Microsoft Word\" and came across this website:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.computorcompanion.com\/LPMArticle.asp?ID=143' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Use Word to Create a Tri-Fold Brochure<\/a><br \/> <br \/> It was super easy to do. Hope this is useful for you!<p>\u00a0<\/p><span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7194\",\"name\":\"Travel Brochure.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":317.5,\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married May 12, 2010<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/kayleys-krama-planning-thread-58704\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/kayleys-gran-bahia-principe-coba-review-may-12-2010-a-60451\/\">Kayley's GBP Coba Review<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kayley2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249666214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220300.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KRama","Id":220300,"Name":"KRama","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"Sh