:"","Email":"marinjacks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.188.199.178","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1320174372,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marooon13","Id":247293,"Name":"marooon13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ba276f028ee31a3eafa1d820771097e","RawContent":"Wow everything looks great!! Thank you so much for the templates...especially the passport stamps, I&#039;ve been looking for those everywhere:). Hope you have an amazing trip &amp; day, looks like you&#039;re very well planned:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1581406,"PostDate":1329047785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow everything looks great!! Thank you so much for the templates...especially the passport stamps, I've been looking for those everywhere:). Hope you have an amazing trip & day, looks like you're very well planned:)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jameigeiras@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.32.33.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327254599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250336.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenn43","Id":250336,"Name":"Jenn43","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4af8edf57123069d76dbc87d8b75a6aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on you pending nuptials!.   I love it.&amp;nbsp; These are all great ideas.&amp;nbsp; Now I&#039;m going to looking into the folders.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!!&amp;nbsp; Where did you find the list before you modified it?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t have enough post to download yours.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1581523,"PostDate":1329065681,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on you pending nuptials!.\u00a0\u00a0 I love it.\u00a0 These are all great ideas.\u00a0 Now I'm going to looking into the folders.\u00a0 Thanks!!\u00a0 Where did you find the list before you modified it?\u00a0 I don't have enough post to download yours.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Its done.....you can read my planning journal or the review...long over due.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/87359\/a-year-and-some-in-the-making-sorry-for-the-lateness-of-this-planning-journal-08-04-12-sunset-beach-resort-montego-bay-jamaica\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/87359\/a-year-and-some-in-the-making-sorry-for-the-lateness-of-this-planning-journal-08-04-12-sunset-beach-resort-montego-bay-jamaica<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lasonyadj@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1317037417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245877.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrlddst","Id":245877,"Name":"mrlddst","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e7c01ae9aa49ee48e58a0422673b5ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;I&#039;m so sorry, I have absolutely no idea where I found it! I used Excel to make my own (pasting the final version into powerpoint), using lists I found on different cruise\/travel advice websites.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mrlddst&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Congrats on you pending nuptials!.   I love it.&amp;nbsp; These are all great ideas.&amp;nbsp; Now I&#039;m going to looking into the folders.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!!&amp;nbsp; Where did you find the list before you modified it?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t have enough post to download yours.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1581538,"PostDate":1329070431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span>I'm so sorry, I have absolutely no idea where I found it! I used Excel to make my own (pasting the final version into powerpoint), using lists I found on different cruise\/travel advice websites.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>mrlddst<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congrats on you pending nuptials!.\u00a0\u00a0 I love it.\u00a0 These are all great ideas.\u00a0 Now I'm going to looking into the folders.\u00a0 Thanks!!\u00a0 Where did you find the list before you modified it?\u00a0 I don't have enough post to download yours.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"