{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":32,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":8979,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1665759,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1348329895,"LastPoster":{"Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":74,"Preview":{"Id":1665759,"PostDate":1348329895,"PostContent":"Hi All,  \u00a0  I'm not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one w...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be2dcfb96176f3fe1e4d77f0b1f24671","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi All,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint&#039;s rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side. &amp;nbsp;I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn&#039;t find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com. &amp;nbsp;There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web! &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s amazing! &amp;nbsp;It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works. &amp;nbsp;Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier. &amp;nbsp;There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So, here&#039;s a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back. &amp;nbsp;All custom coloured and matching! &amp;nbsp;Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it&#039;s too much?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163869\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1665759,"PostDate":1348329895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi All,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share! \u00a0I'm planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint's rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side. \u00a0I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn't find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com. \u00a0There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web! \u00a0It's amazing! \u00a0It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works. \u00a0Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier. \u00a0There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So, here's a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back. \u00a0All custom coloured and matching! \u00a0Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts? \u00a0I'm kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it's too much?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163869\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8475b3e252459eccbba20402d6886749","RawContent":"They look great! And I love your timeline! I&#039;m partial to the second one, I like the orange one too though. These are my colors too! They are gorgeous together!","Attachments":[],"Id":1665779,"PostDate":1348338838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They look great! And I love your timeline! I'm partial to the second one, I like the orange one too though. These are my colors too! They are gorgeous together!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21400f5df559f1130181762bc803335a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n They look great! And I love your timeline! I&#039;m partial to the second one, I like the orange one too though. These are my colors too! They are gorgeous together![\/quote] \n Thanks so much!  Love this colour combination eh?  It&#039;s great!","Attachments":[],"Id":1665780,"PostDate":1348338972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> They look great! And I love your timeline! I'm partial to the second one, I like the orange one too though. These are my colors too! They are gorgeous together!<\/blockquote> <p> Thanks so much! \u00a0Love this colour combination eh? \u00a0It's great! \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bc01d9337cd5404fbdcd2fbaadbf1c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been working on programs for the wedding too. &amp;nbsp;Just waiting to show them to FH and see what he thinks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163877\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163877\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163878\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163878\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1665782,"PostDate":1348339196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've been working on programs for the wedding too. \u00a0Just waiting to show them to FH and see what he thinks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163877\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163877\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163878\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163878\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1983c19fb6a1710d168739d0e09789db","RawContent":"I like this too! I&#039;ve started mine but now I&#039;m wondering if I should have asked the WC at our resort exactly how the timelines usually go? ...like your has a signing of the registrar... Should I add it?","Attachments":[],"Id":1665783,"PostDate":1348339727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I like this too! I've started mine but now I'm wondering if I should have asked the WC at our resort exactly how the timelines usually go? ...like your has a signing of the registrar... Should I add it?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b50166d4837ead6a3a7951f2cd980b7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I like this too! I&#039;ve started mine but now I&#039;m wondering if I should have asked the WC at our resort exactly how the timelines usually go? ...like your has a signing of the registrar... Should I add it?[\/quote] \n Thanks!  Yeah, my timeline is a bit of a guess at the moment.  Still need to nail that down with our coordinator.  And the order of the ceremony I just copied off of someone else&#039;s program!  I have to take a look at our script and see exactly what we&#039;re doing.  I think it&#039;s pretty typical to have the signing of the register, but definitely not necessary.  I&#039;d say, if you have space, add it - if not, just leave it.   \n \n Would love to see what yours looks like when you&#039;re done!","Attachments":[],"Id":1665784,"PostDate":1348340059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I like this too! I've started mine but now I'm wondering if I should have asked the WC at our resort exactly how the timelines usually go? ...like your has a signing of the registrar... Should I add it?<\/blockquote> <p> Thanks! \u00a0Yeah, my timeline is a bit of a guess at the moment. \u00a0Still need to nail that down with our coordinator. \u00a0And the order of the ceremony I just copied off of someone else's program! \u00a0I have to take a look at our script and see exactly what we're doing. \u00a0I think it's pretty typical to have the signing of the register, but definitely not necessary. \u00a0I'd say, if you have space, add it - if not, just leave it. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Would love to see what yours looks like when you're done!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c235af2563727f3b784fbd56687e69f2","RawContent":"&lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1094\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1560\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1665788,"PostDate":1348341650,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1094\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1560\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bccc34de947d412ede0bade41a06dc8","RawContent":"It looks awesome!!  I see we were both inspired by the same program posted on Weddingbee!  Yours are super cute.  I like that they&#039;re less formal.  Might have to show FH to see if he likes that style better.  I like the idea of a raffia bow... especially if you&#039;ll have them on raffia fans.   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1665791,"PostDate":1348344574,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It looks awesome!! \u00a0I see we were both inspired by the same program posted on Weddingbee! \u00a0Yours are super cute. \u00a0I like that they're less formal. \u00a0Might have to show FH to see if he likes that style better. \u00a0I like the idea of a raffia bow... especially if you'll have them on raffia fans. \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1094\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1560\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316804745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0011a3a161724ba644c7a8a37af6da32","RawContent":"I did find the template on wedding bee! I LOVE that it is less formal. I wasn&#039;t looking for your average churchy type program. We are young and fun, and already doing things a bit \"different\" . I&#039;m leaning toward the raffia bow myself, thNks for your input! I always appreciate a little help on these things!","Attachments":[],"Id":1665931,"PostDate":1348419122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did find the template on wedding bee! I LOVE that it is less formal. I wasn't looking for your average churchy type program. We are young and fun, and already doing things a bit \"different\" . I'm leaning toward the raffia bow myself, thNks for your input! I always appreciate a little help on these things!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343379180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a7084a9b4f8af31444e1d2c070984dc","RawContent":"Looooove it!!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1666033,"PostDate":1348439006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Looooove it!!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1094\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1560\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mskenyaf@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1261633666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsKenyaF","Id":224078,"Name":"MsKenyaF","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"69552","Title":"My DIY Welcome Letter \/ Wedding Day Timeline","LastPostDate":1424097904},"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
