> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"365f009b9385d9f7ff240d2258f6557f","RawContent":"Looks fabulous! Great idea! The timeline is the cutest! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mimiq[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi All, \n \n I&#039;m not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share!  I&#039;m planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint&#039;s rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side.  I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn&#039;t find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com.  There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web!  It&#039;s amazing!  It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works.  Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier.  There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too! \n \n So, here&#039;s a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back.  All custom coloured and matching!  Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts?  I&#039;m kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it&#039;s too much? \n \n  [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1666035,"PostDate":1348439213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Looks fabulous! Great idea! The timeline is the cutest!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mimiq<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi All,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share! \u00a0I'm planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint's rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side. \u00a0I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn't find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com. \u00a0There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web! \u00a0It's amazing! \u00a0It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works. \u00a0Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier. \u00a0There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So, here's a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back. \u00a0All custom coloured and matching! \u00a0Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts? \u00a0I'm kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it's too much?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163869\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mskenyaf@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1261633666,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224078.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MsKenyaF","Id":224078,"Name":"MsKenyaF","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12cff559ffd551270c0c61b00c780735","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Tulumbride2013\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"523\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/wid