t\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 523px;\" width=\"350\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" height=\"523\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 523px;\" width=\"350\"><\/span> <\/a> these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.<\/p><\/blockquote> Absolutely love this idea! Sooo cute!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lenam_123@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344456248,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258954.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JSLM","Id":258954,"Name":"JSLM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"497a387d12fcd17180439c3caafa6bbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; mimiq, how did you get the clipart to all be the same colors?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I really love your timeline and want to do something similar!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1744036,"PostDate":1365597428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> mimiq, how did you get the clipart to all be the same colors?<\/p> <p> I really love your timeline and want to do something similar!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jmicic@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1338293390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255973.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DestinationGirl","Id":255973,"Name":"DestinationGirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"355794ce1fb37e9576288644cb5da76b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the website!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1744048,"PostDate":1365597966,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the website!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolenemelanson@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"205.206.215.65","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1325769650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249389.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jolene028","Id":249389,"Name":"jolene028","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"290f20194fa1a267e3c00627267eff93","RawContent":"These are gorggggggggg!! I hope everything turned out great!!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mimiq[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi All, \n \n I&#039;m not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share!  I&#039;m planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint&#039;s rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side.  I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn&#039;t find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com.  There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web!  It&#039;s amazing!  It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works.  Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier.  There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too! \n \n So, here&#039;s a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back.  All custom coloured and matching!  Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts?  I&#039;m kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it&#039;s too much? \n \n  [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1744058,"PostDate":1365598766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are gorggggggggg!! I hope everything turned out great!!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mimiq<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi All,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not quite done my project (need to sit down with the fiance and pick which one we like best!), but have had so much fun putting this together that I have to share! \u00a0I'm planning on doing a welcome letter using vistaprint's rack cards and putting a wedding timeline on the back side. \u00a0I loved the pics that I had seen online of these, but couldn't find any free clip art websites until I stumbled across www.clker.com. \u00a0There are a ton of different images and you can edit them right on the web! \u00a0It's amazing! \u00a0It took me a few minutes to work out how the editor works. \u00a0Once I discovered that the objects were grouped (like you can in powerpoint), it was much easier. \u00a0There are lots of different colour effects that you can do too!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So, here's a few pics of the front side of the welcome card and the wedding time line that will go on the back. \u00a0All custom coloured and matching! \u00a0Not sure which front I like best... will discuss with FH, but any thoughts? \u00a0I'm kinda partial to the bright orange one, but maybe it's too much?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163869\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163869\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163866\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163867\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163868\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissica.barnes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364817136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268045.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoyBee322","Id":268045,"Name":"JoyBee322","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7bb4bd7caf94a5d09fafe929c38b8387","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Tulumbride2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.[\/quote] \n These are absolutely gorgeous!!! Beautiful colors too!!! I think I might be using this idea for our programs as well!!! This was very creative! Thanks for sharing Tulumbride2013!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1744063,"PostDate":1365598891,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Tulumbride2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1094\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163880\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163880\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1348355912843_1560\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"163881\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/163881\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> these are my VERY rough drafts. Im thinking instead of the teal bow on the front doing raffia instead. not sure yet though :\/ I printed this out on regular cardstock and voila! lol. I have it set on our raffia fans as it will be at the ceremony.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> These are absolutely gorgeous!!! Beautiful colors too!!! I think I might be using this idea for our programs as well!!! This was very creative! Thanks for sharing Tulumbride2013!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrissica.barnes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364817136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268045.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoyBee322","Id":268045,"Name":"JoyBee322","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d48d07d7be3be909d559f4be998969e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; These are super awesome!! Good job!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1760777,"PostDate":1369342476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are super awesome!! Good job!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Sdurepos@rogers.com","IpAddress":"99.224.7.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364840444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268065.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MayFlowers2014","Id":268065,"Name":"MayFlowers2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc32b21d086598976fe416f6687da45d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great job!! These are lovely!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1761294,"PostDate":1369513048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great job!! These are lovely!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Sdurepos@rogers.com","IpAddress":"99.224.7.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364840444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268065.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MayFlowers2014","Id":268065,"Name":"MayFlowers2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fb68c51025be78d9a8e5e34de6d9f65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Do either of you happen to have a link of the template or the template itself you can email me? If so I would GREATLY appreciate it! My email is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:c.veeder@yahoo.com\"&gt;c.veeder@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt; LOVE this program!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1792829,"PostDate":1376866712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Do either of you happen to have a link of the template or the template itself you can email me? If so I would GREATLY appreciate it! My email is <a href='mailto:c.veeder@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>c.veeder@yahoo.com<\/a> LOVE this program!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c.veeder@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376866658,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sunbrooke","Id":272713,"Name":"Sunbrooke","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.37.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69552,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dd148cc0fad1594384d29ad95567ce4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love this! great job!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848807,"PostDate":1399485470