{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0a4b27bff62a490bde019ed0849b387","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; As DominiqueAmber said, there is a master list of items for the OOT bags. However, I think that OOT bags for cruisers is going to be different than the traditional DW. Imho, it&#039;s in its own category of DW...the awesome DW category. lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366668616649_1536\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have taken some suggestions from the master list. But, I am still trying to tweak it to fit the needs of my cruising guests!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1749572,"PostDate":1366652188,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> As DominiqueAmber said, there is a master list of items for the OOT bags. However, I think that OOT bags for cruisers is going to be different than the traditional DW. Imho, it's in its own category of DW...the awesome DW category. lol\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366668616649_1536\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" style=\"line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have taken some suggestions from the master list. But, I am still trying to tweak it to fit the needs of my cruising guests!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Bride2be4414@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.58.36.78","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1366295632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268722.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CAKnight","Id":268722,"Name":"CAKnight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6164b20750cdda7010888752081f231e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1370126877562_789\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Hey,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I know what you are going through trying to find helpful information.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I have found so much stuff on pinterest that you can compile onto you own page.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;That way you can keep and refer to ideas that you like.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Mine is vow renewal&amp;nbsp; under Pam.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;We are planning to sail from Balitmore to Bermuda and have a Beach ceramony.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I want to have welcome bags in the ships cabins for whomever will be joining us.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;We won&#039;t be having a large groupe so we can afford to spend a little more on the contents.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I have found a ton of things that can be monogramed and have dates.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I found really nice beach bags at Jesses Wedding.com for $12 with the monogram.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I plan on putting little bottles of sun tan lotion, monogramed flip flops with Bermuda and&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;the date, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/FlipSideFlipFlops?page=3\"&gt;http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/FlipSideFlipFlops?page=3&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Ball caps and sun visors for the women at another site that does reasonable monograming.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Just google whatever you think you might want.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Everything that I&#039;am planning to monogram will only have the date 2015 and Bermuda.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;That way it will be a reminder of the event, but usuable for them.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I just hope the ship will help me get these into their rooms.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I will add other little thing like wipes, water bottles and whatever else I think of.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;I will have already sent luggage tags to those that have responded yes to the save the date invites.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;A lot to think about so hope this helps some.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;Tropicqueen&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"47\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1370126877562_788\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\" width=\"66\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763468,"PostDate":1370112495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1370126877562_789\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Hey,<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I know what you are going through trying to find helpful information.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I have found so much stuff on pinterest that you can compile onto you own page.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">That way you can keep and refer to ideas that you like.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Mine is vow renewal\u00a0 under Pam.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">We are planning to sail from Balitmore to Bermuda and have a Beach ceramony.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I want to have welcome bags in the ships cabins for whomever will be joining us.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">We won't be having a large groupe so we can afford to spend a little more on the contents.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I have found a ton of things that can be monogramed and have dates.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I found really nice beach bags at Jesses Wedding.com for $12 with the monogram.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I plan on putting little bottles of sun tan lotion, monogramed flip flops with Bermuda and<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">the date, <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/shop\/FlipSideFlipFlops?page=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/...lipFlops?page=3<\/a><\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Ball caps and sun visors for the women at another site that does reasonable monograming.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Just google whatever you think you might want.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Everything that I'am planning to monogram will only have the date 2015 and Bermuda.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">That way it will be a reminder of the event, but usuable for them.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I just hope the ship will help me get these into their rooms.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I will add other little thing like wipes, water bottles and whatever else I think of.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">I will have already sent luggage tags to those that have responded yes to the save the date invites.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">A lot to think about so hope this helps some.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\">Tropicqueen<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":smile36:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"47\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1370126877562_788\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile36.gif\" width=\"66\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"oconnor.pam@verizon.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1370108382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270176.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tropicqueen","Id":270176,"Name":"tropicqueen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2083a3e0cb311413ed23a5fad1fc2aa","RawContent":"I like your idea of putting only the year on the monogram items. We have a logo with our names on it that I am going to change to Key West &amp; Cozumel since those are our cruise ports. I was debating on the date, but now I&#039;m def going to use your idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":1764093,"PostDate":1370292562,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I like your idea of putting only the year on the monogram items. We have a logo with our names on it that I am going to change to Key West & Cozumel since those are our cruise ports. I was debating on the date, but now I'm def going to use your idea!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenandcasey2014@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.47.3.153","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359675077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265472.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ucfjennifer","Id":265472,"Name":"ucfjennifer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf5796973f7edc3297f674407cee4a1a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am doing the year and St. Thomas... So much to decide on&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1798950,"PostDate":1378811107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am doing 