ll be able to give you info\/experiences on the resorts&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847298,"PostDate":1398772722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Travel agent for sure! \u00a0One that has dealt with past brides as they will be able to give you info\/experiences on the resorts<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"liannabanana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.243.36.191","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1393104052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276829.jpg?_r=1397589644","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LiannaBanana","Id":276829,"Name":"LiannaBanana","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"68305","Title":"To use a travel agent or not to use a travel agent. That is the question!","LastPostDate":1398772722},"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
