{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9bea3f0dfe6bcde63dbfd558502cb37","RawContent":"I&#039;m not sure if it&#039;s WestJet Vacations, but yes, we&#039;re flying WestJet! They were the cheapest, and they fly directly to Mexico from my home town (which is a bonus for our family up there) so I guess they get to be a little stricter. [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jreist[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Any chance you&#039;re going with WestJet Vacations? That sounds like the bullshit policies that they use!! I&#039;ve switched tour companies, and have found that nearly all of them are more flexible than WestJet Vacations.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1646170,"PostDate":1343383395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm not sure if it's WestJet Vacations, but yes, we're flying WestJet!\u00a0They were the cheapest, and they fly directly to Mexico from my home town (which is a bonus for\u00a0our family up there) so I guess they get to be a little stricter.<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jreist<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Any chance you're going with WestJet Vacations? That sounds like the bullshit policies that they use!! I've switched tour companies, and have found that nearly all of them are more flexible than WestJet Vacations.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~ December 5, 2012 ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>~ Las Caletas, Mexico ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anyanatasha@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311177242,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242570.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Branya2012","Id":242570,"Name":"Branya2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a3b31e1725d3356fa074b0211f8d624","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; PS: sorry...I didn&#039;t even notice this thread was about Cruise Weddings!! &lt;span alt=\":embarrest:\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343401720146_855\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/embarrest.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343401720146_854\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/embarrest.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Guess it doesn&#039;t really matter...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1646171,"PostDate":1343383471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> PS: sorry...I didn't even notice this thread was about Cruise Weddings!! <span alt=\":embarrest:\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343401720146_855\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/embarrest.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343401720146_854\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/embarrest.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span>\u00a0Guess it doesn't really matter...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~ December 5, 2012 ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>~ Las Caletas, Mexico ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anyanatasha@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311177242,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242570.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Branya2012","Id":242570,"Name":"Branya2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20ec218108874b6936fd6e1b80534481","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Their flights and service will, I&#039;m sure, be awesome as usual, but their policies for group bookings REALLY suck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m not sure if you have the same policies that they gave me, but for us, if we dropped below 10 rooms then they would readjust the price for EVERY GUEST! And it would go up to whatever the price of the day is at that time (so no fortelling how much it would raise by).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, they would only guarantee the price for as many rooms as we initially requested (10), and if we needed MORE than 10 rooms then the price for those rooms would be re-negotiated again, and likely go up. So we wouldn&#039;t be able to put a firm price on the invitation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; These policies are pretty terrible! I have written a letter to the president of WestJet and am sending it out next week lol THATS how frustrated I am with them!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; But thats just WestJet Vacations Groups [which is different than WestJet and also different than WestJet Vacations...]&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1646339,"PostDate":1343400965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Their flights and service will, I'm sure, be awesome as usual, but their policies for group bookings REALLY suck!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not sure if you have the same policies that they gave me, but for us, if we dropped below 10 rooms then they would readjust the price for EVERY GUEST! And it would go up to whatever the price of the day is at that time (so no fortelling how much it would raise by).\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, they would only guarantee the price for as many rooms as we initially requested (10), and if we needed MORE than 10 rooms then the price for those rooms would be re-negotiated again, and likely go up. So we wouldn't be able to put a firm price on the invitation.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These policies are pretty terrible! I have written a letter to the president of WestJet and am sending it out next week lol THATS how frustrated I am with them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But thats just WestJet Vacations Groups [which is different than WestJet and also different than WestJet Vacations...]\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Iberostar Rose Hall Beach, Montego Bay<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>91 guests and counting....<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jreist@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1331900277,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252809.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jreist","Id":252809,"Name":"jreist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3fa636ea232545f542ed1716ae4ea91","RawContent":"That is definitely an awful deal, especially when it looks like you have a lot of people coming! The policies seem ridiculous...writing a letter is a very good idea, indeed!! I may follow suit, [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jreist[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Their flights and service will, I&#039;m sure, be awesome as usual, but their policies for group bookings REALLY suck!  \n \n I&#039;m not sure if you have the same policies that they gave me, but for us, if we dropped below 10 rooms then they would readjust the price for EVERY GUEST! And it would go up to whatever the price of the day is at that time (so no fortelling how much it would raise by).  \n \n Also, they would only guarantee the price for as many rooms as we initially requested (10), and if we needed MORE than 10 rooms then the price for those rooms would be re-negotiated again, and likely go up. So we wouldn&#039;t be able to put a firm price on the invitation.  \n \n These policies are pretty terrible! I have written a letter to the president of WestJet and am sending it out next week lol THATS how frustrated I am with them! \n \n But thats just WestJet Vacations Groups [which is different than WestJet and also different than WestJet Vacations...][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1647171,"PostDate":1343660936,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That is definitely an awful deal, especially when it looks like you have a lot of people coming! The policies seem ridiculous...writing a letter is a very good idea, indeed!! I may follow suit,<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jreist<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Their flights and service will, I'm sure, be awesome as usual, but their policies for group bookings REALLY suck!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm not sure if you have the same policies that they gave me, but for us, if we dropped below 10 rooms then they would readjust the price for EVERY GUEST! And it would go up to whatever the price of the day is at that time (so no fortelling how much it would raise by).\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, they would only guarantee the price for as many rooms as we initially requested (10), and if we needed MORE than 10 rooms then the price for those rooms would be re-negotiated again, and likely go up. So we wouldn't be able to put a firm price on the invitation.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These policies are pretty terrible! I have written a letter to the president of WestJet and am sending it out next week lol THATS how frustrated I am with them!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But thats just WestJet Vacations Groups [which is different than WestJet and also different than WestJet Vacations...]\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~ December 5, 2012 ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>~ Las Caletas, Mexico ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anyanatasha@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311177242,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242570.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Branya2012","Id":242570,"Name":"Branya2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74da76a9f486866f2d2cbcb944b4c76e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What travel agents have you guys used that were worth it and trouble free (for the most part)?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1763907,"PostDate":1370266684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> What travel agents have you guys used that were worth it and trouble free (for the most part)?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"fpace74@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357473206,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263944.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futrMrsBledsoe","Id":263944,"Name":"futrMrsBledsoe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab7b9550d1164b69ae149fe8d0d2e7fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I decided to go with a travel agent for 2 reasons. 1. I don&#039;t want people calling me and stressing me out with their questions. 2. I don&#039;t want people calling me and stressing me out with their questions. So far my travel agent has been helpful. She is like the middle man between my guests and carnival which is awesome.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1781173,"PostDate":1374433799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I decided to go with a travel agent for 2 reasons. 1. I don't want people calling me and stressing me out with their questions. 2. I don't want people calling me and stressing me out with their questions. So far my travel agent has been helpful. She is like the middle man between my guests and carnival which is awesome.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"creativespicebyshan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336168145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254958.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shanandcal","Id":254958,"Name":"shanandcal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d52ab1f2b1758f1e5be140d84ded9f9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This will be the first time I will be using a travel agent for any vacation but I thought it would be well worth it.&amp;nbsp; Let someone else worry about it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809468,"PostDate":1382648989,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This will be the first time I will be using a travel agent for any vacation but I thought it would be well worth it.\u00a0 Let someone else worry about it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jstopple@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382041654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274341.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BSBRose21","Id":274341,"Name":"BSBRose21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"129.89.103.188","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d64b3add17ff04fda51334e52d39c41e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think I have decided to go with a travel agent as well... but I am wondering now, how long in advance should I set everything up. I am getting married on an alaskan cruise in May of 2015 and haven&#039;t seen but one listed so far. How far in advance did you ladies book?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828586,"PostDate":1390565341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think I have decided to go with a travel agent as well... but I am wondering now, how long in advance should I set everything up. I am getting married on an alaskan cruise in May of 2015 and haven't seen but one listed so far. How far in advance did you ladies book?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"v.hernandez416@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"129.89.103.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338749367,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256211.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"valh416","Id":256211,"Name":"valh416","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.143.153.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e39fad190cf7052dda2be9361698a7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Arranging a regular cruise trip &amp;nbsp;can be very&amp;nbsp;confusing because&amp;nbsp;the terminology and cruise line booking rules are foreign to most&amp;nbsp;people. So, it is very&amp;nbsp;helpful to have someone who understands the process&amp;nbsp;- and a good travel agent will be able to&amp;nbsp;guide you through it.&amp;nbsp; There should not be any \"hidden fees\"&amp;nbsp; when everything is clearly explained and properly arranged.&amp;nbsp; Weddings are especially important events and the event details can be overwhelming.&amp;nbsp; You have enough to handle - do you want to be the one responsible for helping your guests figure out whether to have their stateroom on the LIDO or PROMENADE deck? Or explain 50+ times what documentation is necessary for them to board the ship?&amp;nbsp; Beyond helping you secure a \"great group price\", a good travel agent will save your sanity and very likely be instrumental in helping your group arrive properly&amp;nbsp;prepared for your destination wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830456,"PostDate":1391154237,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Arranging a regular cruise trip \u00a0can be very\u00a0confusing because\u00a0the terminology and cruise line booking rules are foreign to most\u00a0people. So, it is very\u00a0helpful to have someone who understands the process\u00a0- and a good travel agent will be able to\u00a0guide you through it.\u00a0 There should not be any \"hidden fees\"\u00a0 when everything is clearly explained and properly arranged.\u00a0 Weddings are especially important events and the event details can be overwhelming.\u00a0 You have enough to handle - do you want to be the one responsible for helping your guests figure out whether to have their stateroom on the LIDO or PROMENADE deck? Or explain 50+ times what documentation is necessary for them to board the ship?\u00a0 Beyond helping you secure a \"great group price\", a good travel agent will save your sanity and very likely be instrumental in helping your group arrive properly\u00a0prepared for your destination wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kathy@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"50.143.153.161","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1391000664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TAkathy","Id":276390,"Name":"TAkathy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.197.53.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68305,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09a245a63cddabbe35d9fd3d770dc8ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I used a travel agent for the pricing; however, she does not specialize in destination weddings and I regret that decision. It&#039;s frustrating at times.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830460,"PostDate":1391156362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I used a travel agent for the pricing; however, she does not specialize in destination weddings and I regret that decision. It's frustrating at times.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandiesueb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.99.122.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388865717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275879.jpg?_r=1431174019","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Mandiesue","Id":275879,"Name":"Mandiesue","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
