art.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve decided I&#039;d like to go a more casual look for my dress.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s going to be so hot, and I really don&#039;t want to spend $1000+.&amp;nbsp; So I&#039;m wondering if you guys know a place where I could find a nice casual white dress.&amp;nbsp; I prefer full length (not a fan of my legs) but I definitely want the material to be light.&amp;nbsp; I would even like the idea of something completely non-traditional.  A&amp;nbsp; nice designer (or not)&amp;nbsp;dress that just happens to be white?&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m really willing to think outside of the box on this, I just don&#039;t know where to start.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899196,"PostDate":1435139350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey ladies.\u00a0 I've recently had a bit of a change of heart.\u00a0 I've decided I'd like to go a more casual look for my dress.\u00a0 It's going to be so hot, and I really don't want to spend $1000+.\u00a0 So I'm wondering if you guys know a place where I could find a nice casual white dress.\u00a0 I prefer full length (not a fan of my legs) but I definitely want the material to be light.\u00a0 I would even like the idea of something completely non-traditional.\u00a0\u00a0A\u00a0 nice designer (or not)\u00a0dress that just happens to be white?\u00a0I'm really willing to think outside of the box on this, I just don't know where to start.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"344fba0abcb1278ced6b1c68a140c67a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"] Would you consider short?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899198,"PostDate":1435139685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a> Would you consider short?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by trbutler, 24 June 2015 - 10:26 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1435141614,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"107d5997a982dc8cc94cb2c5a338ff70","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was the same way, I went to Alfred Angelo and I looked at Bridesmaids Dresses, I actually ended up with this dress&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.alfredangelo.com\/Collections\/Disney-Maidens\/524\/?pg=1&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.alfredangelo.com\/Collections\/Disney-Maidens\/524\/?pg=1&lt;\/a&gt;it is part of their disney collection. &amp;nbsp;They made it for me in white and I LOVED it! &amp;nbsp;And it was only $200.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899199,"PostDate":1435141587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was the same way, I went to Alfred Angelo and I looked at Bridesmaids Dresses, I actually ended up with this dress\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.alfredangelo.com\/Collections\/Disney-Maidens\/524\/?pg=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.alfredang...idens\/524\/?pg=1<\/a>it is part of their disney collection. \u00a0They made it for me in white and I LOVED it! \u00a0And it was only $200.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384958390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9971cbdaa79899b1e66910751476889b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@trbutler&amp;nbsp; That is SO pretty!! What date was your wedding? Do you have pictures that you can post, and are you selling anything? And congrats by the way!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899207,"PostDate":1435146146,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@trbutler\u00a0 That is SO pretty!! What date was your wedding? Do you have pictures that you can post, and are you selling anything? And congrats by the way!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.149.182.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95a9a952930f2e3891714f12bf0d2ede","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"] There are so many pretty casual white dresses in stores right now. There are a lot of short ones but I&#039;ve seen a fair number of full length dresses as we. I got my dress made at Champagne and Cupcakes on Queen West but they also sell off the rack dresses and they have this really pretty full length white dress that would be perfect on the beach! I&#039;ve been eyeing it and I might still get it to wear another night - haha! I think it&#039;s around $150-160. It&#039;s simple but very pretty, light weight and flowy.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899226,"PostDate":1435157541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a> There are so many pretty casual white dresses in stores right now. There are a lot of short ones but I've seen a fair number of full length dresses as we. I got my dress made at Champagne and Cupcakes on Queen West but they also sell off the rack dresses and they have this really pretty full length white dress that would be perfect on the beach! I've been eyeing it and I might still get it to wear another night - haha! I think it's around $150-160. It's simple but very pretty, light weight and flowy.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415529511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2eab6a0a6431f8cf5a3935e67ccd48b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I believe David&#039;s Bridal would have a large selection for you in wedding and bridesmaid&#039;s dresses that are more on the casual side. They have a large large selection under $1000. &amp;nbsp;My wedding gown was only $500. You can look online too - just use the online shopping area, then choose Canada and you will find pages and pages of dresses. You can also narrow your search by styles, prices, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Le Chateau may have something. &amp;nbsp;Laura also has a selection of dresses, but I haven&#039;t seen white there - although I wasn&#039;t really looking. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;RW&amp;amp;Co had a cute spring dress recently that was white also.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899231,"PostDate":1435160395,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I believe David's Bridal would have a large selection for you in wedding and bridesmaid's dresses that are more on the casual side. They have a large large selection under $1000. \u00a0My wedding gown was only $500. You can look online too - just use the online shopping area, then choose Canada and you will find pages and pages of dresses. You can also narrow your search by styles, prices, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Le Chateau may have something. \u00a0Laura also has a selection of dresses, but I haven't seen white there - although I wasn't really looking. \u00a0 \u00a0RW&Co had a cute spring dress recently that was white also.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.49.243.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by snswedding2016, 24 June 2015 - 10:04 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1435183454,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dad5265b8ffdb059df29118d40d4a716","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I was at Champagne and Cupcakes tonight and they actually have a couple more white dresses than I remembered. She&#039;s got a couple of simple and very elegant flowy white dresses ranging from $150-450.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you can get past the intense perfume smell Abercrombie has some really cute white dresses (not sure if that is too casual) and I walked by Club Monaco today and they was a beautiful long white flowing dressing on a mannequin in the window. The more I go shopping the more I think i&#039;m going to end up wear white all week long in Mexico\u2026there&#039;s such cute stuff out there right now! ahh must stop shopping!! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899251,"PostDate":1435183423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I was at Champagne and Cupcakes tonight and they actually have a couple more white dresses than I remembered. She's got a couple of simple and very elegant flowy white dresses ranging from $150-450.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you can get past the intense perfume smell Abercrombie has some really cute white dresses (not sure if that is too casual) and I walked by Club Monaco today and they was a beautiful long white flowing dressing on a mannequin in the window. The more I go shopping the more I think i'm going to end up wear white all week long in Mexico\u2026there's such cute stuff out there right now! ahh must stop shopping!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415529511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70a641525078c7da1aedcfefa0b267f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"] I am seeing white dresses everywhere lately! Probably partly because I was originally thinking a white sundress (short) as my wedding dress. I stepped it up a notch and ended up with a short dress from David&#039;s that is pretty much a white cocktail dress. But I&#039;m having second thoughts so still keeping my eyes open.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve been looking for short, so not sure about long, but white seems really popular right now and long\/maxi dresses are very popular, so there&#039;s bound to be something. I saw lots of white dresses at both Winners and Marshall&#039;s even! Have you checked J. Crew or Ann Taylor bridal collections? BM dresses are another good idea, as&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"trbutler\"] pointed out. I was also looking at short BM dresses at one point.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;P.S.&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"trbutler\"] Your dress is beautiful. Seeing it on a bride, in white (or something similar), I don&#039;t think you would ever know it&#039;s a BM dress. How did you get them to make it in white? It doesn&#039;t look like white is an option. I found a BM dress that I really liked, but the closest it came to white was a dove grey.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899264,"PostDate":1435190774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a> I am seeing white dresses everywhere lately! Probably partly because I was originally thinking a white sundress (short) as my wedding dress. I stepped it up a notch and ended up with a short dress from David's that is pretty much a white cocktail dress. But I'm having second thoughts so still keeping my eyes open.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been looking for short, so not sure about long, but white seems really popular right now and long\/maxi dresses are very popular, so there's bound to be something. I saw lots of white dresses at both Winners and Marshall's even! Have you checked J. Crew or Ann Taylor bridal collections? BM dresses are another good idea, as\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> pointed out. I was also looking at short BM dresses at one point.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>P.S.\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> Your dress is beautiful. Seeing it on a bride, in white (or something similar), I don't think you would ever know it's a BM dress. How did you get them to make it in white? It doesn't look like white is an option. I found a BM dress that I really liked, but the closest it came to white was a dove grey.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e26787d649a16afcadf7276f81269baa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks ladies!&amp;nbsp; Your suggestions have helped, and I might stop in to Champagne and Cupcakes still @[member=\"snswedding2016\"] - their website doesn&#039;t show much.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also seeing a ton on BCBG!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bcbg.com\/Magnolia-Strapless-Gown\/NST6P904-A1D,en_CA,pd.html?dwvar_NST6P904-A1D_color=A1D&amp;amp;cgid=dresses-by-category-gowns-evening-gowns#start=104&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bcbg.com\/Magnolia-Strapless-Gown\/NST6P904-A1D,en_CA,pd.html?dwvar_NST6P904-A1D_color=A1D&amp;amp;cgid=dresses-by-category-gowns-evening-gowns#start=104&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899270,"PostDate":1435212456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks ladies!\u00a0 Your suggestions have helped, and I might stop in to Champagne and Cupcakes still @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> - their website doesn't show much.\u00a0 I'm also seeing a ton on BCBG!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bcbg.com\/Magnolia-Strapless-Gown\/NST6P904-A1D,en_CA,pd.html?dwvar_NST6P904-A1D_color=A1D&cgid=dresses-by-category-gowns-evening-gowns#start=104' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bcbg.com\/...gowns#start=104<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424038909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.119.165.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79314,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd4e0ad13344f48fce32e9990c51c179","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The bridesmaid dresses at BHLDN are beautiful!&amp;nbsp; I considered getting one myself.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/bridesmaids-bridesmaid-dresses\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/bridesmaids-bridesmaid-dresses\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also love design Tadashi Shoji&#039;s evening gowns. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tadashishoji.com\/shop\/wedding\/bride&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tadashishoji.com\/shop\/wedding\/bride&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899273,"PostDate":1435220803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The bridesmaid dresses at BHLDN are beautiful!\u00a0 I considered getting one myself.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/bridesmaids-bridesmaid-dresses\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bhldn.com...esmaid-dresses\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also love design Tadashi Shoji's evening gowns. <a href='http:\/\/www.tadashishoji.com\/shop\/wedding\/bride' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tadashish...p\/wedding\/bride<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415103095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79314","Title":"Good Options For A Casual Dress?","LastPostDate":1435956801},"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
